rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2006-09-25\', \'text\': "Clockspinning can affect any kind of counter, not just a time counter. The type of counter isn\'t chosen until resolution. Whether to add or remove a counter isn\'t chosen until resolution."}, {\'date\': \'2006-09-25\', \'text\': \'If the target is a permanent and it has no counter on it when Clockspinning resolves, nothing happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'A face-down creature spell will cause Opal Guardian’s ability to trigger (if it’s an enchantment).'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'After the triggered ability resolves, Opal Guardian is no longer an enchantment.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Guardian’s effect doesn’t wear off.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger “at the beginning of [your] upkeep” will trigger at the beginning of each additional upkeep as well.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If an effect causes the enchanted player to skip their upkeep step, this ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If echo triggers during the first upkeep, it won’t trigger again during the second upkeep since the creature won’t have enter the battlefield since that player’s last upkeep.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If two Paradox Hazes enchant the same player, they’ll both trigger when that player’s first upkeep of the turn begins. The player will get two additional upkeep steps.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Paradox Haze targets a player when it’s cast, and it enters the battlefield attached to that player.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Aetherflame Wall can block creatures with shadow and creatures without shadow.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Aetherflame Wall gains shadow, it won’t be able to block any creatures (not even those with shadow).'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'After Glass Asp’s triggered ability resolves, the affected player has the ability to perform a special action of paying {2}. This action may be performed any time the player has priority, and it doesn’t use the stack. It may be performed only once. Once that player’s next draw step begins, the player no longer has the ability to perform this action. If the player performed the action, the delayed “lose 2 life” triggered ability won’t trigger. Otherwise, it will.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Cavalry Master adds only one instance of flanking per creature, even if that creature already has multiple instances of flanking.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If a creature without flanking is given flanking by another effect, then this ability will grant a second instance. Similarly, if a creature loses flanking, then it won’t get the Calvary Master instance either.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Colored costs can’t be reduced by this effect. For example, a spell that costs {2}{R} can’t be reduced by more than {2}.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Locket of Yesterdays reduces only the amount of mana you need to pay to cast a spell. The spell’s mana cost and mana value are not affected.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The spell being cast doesn’t reduce its own cost, even if you’re casting it from a graveyard. At the time the cost is reduced, the spell is on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Detainment Spell prevents mana abilities of the enchanted creature from being activated.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Morph isn’t an activated ability, so Detainment Spell doesn’t prevent face-down creatures from being able to turn face up.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Responding to a creature’s activated ability being activated by moving Detainment Spell onto that creature won’t affect the ability that was just activated.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Each Sliver deals damage to its controller (not to Plague Sliver’s controller).'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Face-down spells are creature spells, but they have mana value 0.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The second ability is a state trigger. Once it triggers, it won’t trigger again as long as the ability is on the stack. If the ability is countered and the trigger condition is still true, it will immediately trigger again.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When the second ability resolves, Endrek Sahr will be sacrificed regardless of how many Thrulls you control at that time, even if it’s less than seven.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Here’s how this works: Step 1: You reveal the top five cards of your library. Step 2: You separate those cards into two piles. (A pile can have zero cards.) Step 3: An opponent of your choice chooses one of those piles. Step 4: You choose one of the cards in the chosen pile. Step 5: You put the chosen card in your hand. Step 6: You put all other revealed cards (from both piles) on the bottom of your library in any order.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Chronosavant is in your graveyard, you can activate this ability multiple times in response to itself. The first one that resolves will return Chronosavant to the battlefield and make you skip your next turn. The others will just make you skip turns.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Durkwood Tracker has left the battlefield before the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t do anything. If the targeted creature has left the battlefield before the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Flickering Spirit’s ability is activated, any “as this enters the battlefield” choices for it are made by its owner, not its previous controller.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When the ability resolves, Flickering Spirit is exiled, then immediately returned to the battlefield. It returns as a “new” creature. Any counters, Auras, and so on are removed. Any spells or abilities targeting Flickering Spirit no longer target it.'}, {'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'If a token copy of Flickering Spirit uses its activated ability, the token will not return to the battlefield, because of the rule that says tokens that leave the battlefield can’t return.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Fool’s Demise and the enchanted creature go to the graveyard from the battlefield at the same time, both abilities will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Ixidron and another creature are entering the battlefield at the same time, the other creature enters the battlefield face up.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The controller of a face-down creature can look at it at any time, even if it doesn’t have morph. Other players can’t, but the rules for face-down permanents state that “you must ensure at all times that your face-down spells and permanents can be easily differentiated from each other.” As a result, all players must be able to figure out what each of the creatures Ixidron turned face down is.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Turning a face-down creature face-down typically has no effect; the creature’s status is unchanged.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'You turn the creatures face-down *as* Ixidron enters the battlefield. There is never a moment when Ixidron is on the battlefield and the creatures are face-up. If a creature on the battlefield has a “whenever another creature enters the battlefield” ability, it won’t trigger because that creature will be face down before Ixidron enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Creatures turned face down by Ixidron are 2/2 creatures with no text, no name, no subtypes, no expansion symbol, and no mana cost. These values are copiable if an object becomes a copy of one of those creatures, and their normal values are not copiable.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Moonlace is cast on a spell that becomes a permanent (a creature spell, an artifact spell, or an enchantment spell), the permanent will enter the battlefield colorless and will remain colorless until it leaves the battlefield (or until another effect changes its color).'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Moonlace’s effect doesn’t wear off.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Pull from Eternity affects a card that’s haunting a creature, the haunt effect ends.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Pull from Eternity affects a suspended card, the card loses its time counters and is no longer suspended. (This doesn’t trigger the last ability of suspend.)'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Pull from Eternity targets a card in the exile zone. A card is only face down in the exile zone if the effect that put it there specifically says so.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Trickbind counters an activated ability of a permanent, no activated abilities of that permanent can be activated for the remainder of the turn. This includes activated abilities other than the one that was countered, as well as any mana abilities that permanent may have. Other abilities of that permanent, including triggered abilities and static abilities, are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Trickbind can be used to counter the echo triggered ability. If so, the echo ability won’t trigger again so the echo cost is never paid.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Trickbind can be used to counter the flanking triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Trickbind can be used to counter the madness triggered ability. The affected card will remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Trickbind can be used to counter the storm triggered ability. Doing so prevents the copies from being created, but doesn’t counter the original storm spell.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Trickbind can be used to counter the suspend “remove a counter” ability. If so, the counter won’t get removed, but the ability will trigger again as normal later on. Trickbind can also be used to counter the suspend “play this card” ability. If so, the card stays exiled (the ability won’t trigger again). Using suspend to exile a card in your hand is neither an activated nor a triggered ability, so it can’t be countered this way.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Trickbind can’t counter or prevent paying the morph cost to turn a face-down creature face up, since that action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Vampiric Sliver is put into a graveyard from the battlefield at the same time as a creature dealt damage by another Sliver, the Vampiric Sliver’s ability will trigger for the other Sliver. That Sliver will get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If a Sliver doesn’t have this ability when it deals damage, but does have it when the damaged creature is put into a graveyard, the ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If a Sliver has this ability when it deals damage, but not when the damaged creature is put into a graveyard, nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If a Vesuvan Shapeshifter that’s copying Cyclopean Giant is put into a graveyard, the Shapeshifter will be exiled when the ability resolves even though it’s not a Cyclopean Giant anymore.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If the triggered ability doesn’t resolve (the targeted land becomes an illegal target, for example), Cyclopean Giant remains in the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If a spell would deal damage to multiple creatures and/or players, Plated Pegasus will prevent 1 damage that the spell would deal to each of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If an effect says Foriysian Interceptor can’t block, then it can’t block any creatures.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The third ability normally lets Foriysian Interceptor block two creatures. If another effect also lets it block an additional creature, the effects are cumulative.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If an effect says Foriysian Totem can’t block, then it can’t block any creatures.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The third ability normally lets Foriysian Totem block two creatures. If another effect also lets it block an additional creature, the effects are cumulative.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature has shadow, it won’t be able to block any creatures (not even those with shadow).'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The enchanted creature can block creatures with shadow and creatures without shadow.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If you choose to have Zealot il-Vec deal 1 damage to a creature and that damage is prevented or replaced, Zealot il-Vec’s combat damage will still be prevented.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When Zealot il-Vec attacks and isn’t blocked, you must choose a target for its ability even if you don’t use it.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn’t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If you don’t actually sacrifice the Goblin (because it was removed from the battlefield before the ability resolved, for example), no damage is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If you have another creature on the battlefield when the ability resolves, you must sacrifice it. You can’t choose to be dealt 7 damage instead.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice Liege of the Pit to its own ability. You can sacrifice one Liege of the Pit to another Liege of the Pit.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If you return Ghitu Firebreathing to its owner’s hand while the +1/+0 ability is on the stack, that ability will still give the creature that was last enchanted by Ghitu Firebreathing +1/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Norin the Wary will be exiled if it attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Removing the other Dragon card from your graveyard has no effect on Scion of the Ur-Dragon.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When Scion of the Ur-Dragon becomes a copy of another Dragon, it loses its copy ability for the rest of the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Sporesower Thallid’s triggered ability will put a spore counter on each Fungus creature you control, even if that Fungus doesn’t have any abilities that makes use of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The Sengir Nosferatu that the Bat token’s ability returns to the battlefield doesn’t have to be the same one that created it, and it doesn’t even have to be owned by the same player.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'If the Nosferatu is copied (by Clone, for example) and then the copy is exiled by the first activated ability, it won’t be able to come back using the second activated ability, since it’s no longer named Sengir Nosferatu in the Exile zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The additional cost must be paid if Gaze of Justice is cast with flashback.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The creature’s controller (not Fallen Ideal’s controller) can activate the “sacrifice a creature” ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The number of cards the player draws is equal to the number of cards they discarded, not the amount of damage dealt by Barbed Shocker.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The target of the spell is a creature the chosen opponent controls. As Evangelize resolves, if the target isn’t a creature controlled by the chosen opponent, Evangelize won’t resolve. If Evangelize’s target is changed (via Shunt, for example), the new target must be a creature controlled by the chosen opponent.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When you put the spell on the stack, you choose an opponent, then that opponent chooses the target. This is not a choice made on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The third ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent of the player who controls Ophidian Eye.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The token is put onto the battlefield under the control of the player who controls the enchanted creature, not the player who controls Verdant Embrace.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Unless something weird happens, the card that’s drawn will be the card that was revealed.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Weathered Bodyguards affects only combat damage from unblocked creatures. It won’t affect noncombat damage, and it won’t affect trample damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Weatherseed Totem will be returned to its owner’s hand if it was a creature at the time it was put into a graveyard from the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When damage is dealt to Phyrexian Totem, its triggered ability will trigger. A number of permanents equal to the amount of damage dealt will be sacrificed when the ability resolves. It doesn’t matter if Phyrexian Totem isn’t on the battlefield when the ability resolves, as long as Phyrexian Totem was a creature as it left the battlefield. If one of the permanents sacrificed is Phyrexian Totem itself, the requisite number of other permanents must still be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When the life totals are exchanged, each player gains or loses the amount of life necessary to equal the other player’s previous life total. For example, if player A has 5 life and player B has 3 life before the exchange, player A will lose 2 life and player B will gain 2 life. Replacement effects may modify these gains and losses, and triggered abilities may trigger on them.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If an effect says that a player can’t lose life, that player can’t exchange life totals with a player who has a lower life total; in that case, the exchange won’t happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'You can cast Serra Avenger during another player’s first, second, or third turns of the game if some other effect (such as Vedalken Orrery) enables that.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the game is restarted (by Karn Liberated), you can’t cast Serra Avenger in your first, second, or third turn in the new game.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Serra Avenger cares about how many turns you have taken, not necessarily how many turns the game has had, in case you take an extra turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': '“Can’t block” abilities apply only as blockers are declared. After Ironclaw Buzzardiers blocks, increasing the blocked creature’s power won’t make it become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-10-15', 'text': 'Anything that triggers during the resolution of this will wait to be put on the stack until everything is put onto the battlefield and resolution is complete. The player whose turn it is will put all of their triggered abilities on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order will do the same. (The last ability put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a player chooses not to put a card onto the battlefield but the process repeats, that player may put a card onto the battlefield the next time the process gets around to them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The permanents enter the battlefield sequentially. This means that ones put onto the battlefield earlier may affect how later ones enter and later ones may cause triggered abilities of earlier ones to trigger, but not vice versa.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The process ends when all players (starting with you) choose not to put a card onto the battlefield during one loop of the process. It doesn’t end the first time one player chooses not to put a card onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': '”Your next untap…” refers to the player who controls Spectral Force when the triggered ability resolves. That means if it’s temporarily stolen (such as with Word of Seizing) and attacked with, it will untap in its previous controller’s untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can choose differently for each copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities of the creatures sacrificed may modify or trigger on the lands being sacrificed, but won’t modify or trigger on the cards being discarded. Abilities of the sacrificed lands won’t modify or trigger on the creatures being sacrificed or the cards being discarded.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger during this process will wait to be put onto the stack until Restore Balance is done resolving.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As Restore Balance resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses the appropriate number of lands they control, then each other player in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all the lands that weren’t chosen are sacrificed at the same time. Then, starting with the player whose turn it is again, each player chooses the appropriate number of creatures they control, then sacrifice their other creatures after all choices have been made. Finally, players choose cards in hand without revealing them in the same order and discard the remaining cards.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'While Living End is resolving, first each player exiles their graveyard at the same time, then each player sacrifices all creatures they control at the same time, and finally each player puts their exiled cards onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“All cards they exiled this way” refers only to the cards exiled in the first part of the effect. If a replacement effect (such as that of Leyline of the Void) exiles any of the sacrificed creatures instead of putting them into the graveyard, those cards aren’t returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Creatures that come under your control after Fortify resolves won\'t get the chosen bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'You choose the mode as you cast Fortify, not as it resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Sliver may become lethal if Might Sliver leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Sliver may become lethal if Sedge Sliver leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to another Sliver may become lethal if Watcher Sliver leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature loses double strike after assigning damage in the first strike combat damage step (due to Fury Sliver leaving the battlefield, for example), that creature won’t assign damage in the normal combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If multiple Slivers owned by one player would die at the same time, that player chooses any of those Slivers and puts them on top of their library in any order. They don’t reveal this order.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The replacement effect that Pulmonic Sliver grants to all Slivers applies to Pulmonic Sliver and any Slivers that would die at the same time as it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If multiple sources deal damage to a Sliver at the same time and that Sliver survives the damage, it gets only one +1/+1 counter despite its impressive efforts.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a Sliver has become blocked by a creature without flanking, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 even if the blocked Sliver loses flanking before the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability Harmonic Sliver grants itself triggers when it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The controller of the Sliver that enters the battlefield controls the triggered ability for that Sliver and chooses what to destroy, not necessarily the controller of Harmonic Sliver.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn’t provide any additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If an effect gives Magus of the Disk indestructible or regenerates it, it won’t be destroyed by its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it’s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of menace on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'In a Commander game where this card is your commander, you cannot suspend it from the Command zone.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Ith’s ability can target an untapped attacking creature. It will still prevent any combat damage dealt to and dealt by that creature this turn.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The creature isn’t removed from combat; it just has its damage prevented. It’s still an attacking creature until the combat phase is complete.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can activate Ith’s ability targeting an attacking creature you control during the combat damage step or the end of combat step. It’ll untap and the damage it had already dealt won’t be undone.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures or players are illegal targets as Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost. It won\'t be dealt instead to a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability has and how the damage is divided as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Assembly-Worker\'s ability can target any creature with the Assembly-Worker subtype, not only creatures named Assembly-Worker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Fortune Thief doesn\'t change how much damage is dealt; it just changes how much life that damage makes you lose. Abilities such as lifelink will see the full amount of damage being dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Fortune Thief won\'t prevent you from losing the game if your life total becomes 0 or less or if some other effect causes you to lose the game."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Fortune Thief\'s effect applies only if your life total is being reduced by damage. Other effects or costs (such as losing or paying life) can reduce your life total below 1 as normal."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Fortune Thief\'s effect is not a prevention effect. It stops unpreventable damage from reducing your life total below 1."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If your life total is less than 1 but you\'ve somehow avoided losing the game, Fortune Thief\'s effect won\'t apply at all if you\'re dealt damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "After Outrider en-Kor\'s activated ability has resolved, if multiple sources would deal damage to Outrider en-Kor simultaneously that turn (which can happen if Outrider en-Kor is blocked by multiple creatures, for example), you choose which source has its 1 damage redirected. If Outrider en-Kor’s ability has resolved more than once that turn, you may choose a different source for each redirection effect."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the targeted creature leaves the battlefield after the activated ability resolves but before Outrider en-Kor would be dealt damage, the damage isn’t redirected away from Outrider en-Kor. The same is true if the target is no longer a creature (or a planeswalker) at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The damage dealt to the target is dealt by the original source of damage, not by Outrider en-Kor.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability copies Return to Dust, the copy exiles only the first target artifact or enchantment. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Return to Dust can always target a second artifact or enchantment; it just won\'t exile it if it\'s not your main phase when you cast Return to Dust."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect says that something doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step, that effect applies to the next untap step that isn\'t skipped."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Skipping your "next" untap step is cumulative. If a player turns two Brine Elementals face up on the same turn, that player\\\'s opponents will each skip their next two untap steps.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the creature\'s power is negative, you still add its power and toughness to determine how much life is lost. If that total is negative, its controller doesn\'t gain or lose any life. For example, Phthisis destroying a -1/3 creature would cause a loss of 2 life. Pthisis destroying a -4/3 creature would cause no loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Phthisis tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player loses life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose the target for Dread Return before paying any of its costs, so it\'s not possible to cast it using flashback and bring back one of the creatures you sacrifice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A creature can be dealt an amount of damage greater than its toughness. For example, if Stuffy Doll is dealt 3 damage, its triggered ability deals 3 damage, not 1, to the chosen player.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Stuffy Doll is dealt damage, you lose the game before its triggered ability goes on the stack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A player\\\'s "opening hand" is the hand of cards the player has after all players have taken mulligans. If players have any cards in hand that allow actions to be taken with them from a player\\\'s opening hand, the starting player takes all such actions first in any order, followed by each other player in turn order. Then the first turn begins.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If multiple Gemstone Caverns are put onto the battlefield under a single player\\\'s control before the game begins, the "legend rule" won\\\'t put the extras into that player\\\'s graveyard until just before the starting player gets priority during the game\\\'s first upkeep step. There\\\'s no opportunity to tap the extras for mana.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Dralnu may be one of the permanents you sacrifice while applying its replacement effect.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Dralnu would be dealt more damage than the number of permanents you control, instead you sacrifice all permanents you control.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card has multiple instances of flashback, you may choose any of its flashback costs to pay.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost gains flashback, it has no flashback cost. It can’t be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a split card gains flashback, you pay only the cost of the half you’re casting.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If any of the sacrificed permanents would deal or be dealt damage at the same time as Dralnu, they deal or are dealt damage at the same time that they’re sacrificed. Any abilities of the sacrificed permanents that would trigger on that damage don’t trigger, but abilities of other permanents that trigger on that damage do.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with flashback, you can’t pay any alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell with flashback.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If X is 0, Conflagrate has no targets and deals no damage.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the mana value of that spell, even if it was cast with flashback and no mana was spent on X.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If some of the targets become illegal for Conflagrate, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn’t dealt at all.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you cast Conflagrate, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. You can’t choose more than X targets and assign 0 damage to a target.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A token you own that dies is put into your graveyard before it ceases to exist.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Nether Traitor and another creature are put into your graveyard at the same time, Nether Traitor’s ability won’t trigger. This is because it must be in your graveyard before the creature dies in order for its ability that returns it to the battlefield to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If multiple creatures are put into your graveyard at the same time, Nether Traitor’s ability triggers for each of them. Once you return it to the battlefield, you may pay {B} for the other abilities as they resolve, but they’ll have no effect if you do. Even if Nether Traitor returns to your graveyard, it’s considered a new object and won’t be returned.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Casting a spell with split second won\'t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can\'t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Split second doesn\'t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Angel’s Grace doesn’t prevent damage. It only changes the result of damage dealt to you. For example, a 5/5 creature with lifelink that deals damage to you will still cause its controller to gain 5 life, even if that damage reduces your life total from 3 to 1.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Angel’s Grace doesn’t stop loss of life from effects that say that you lose life.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you have less than 1 life, damage dealt to you reduces your life total further below 0 (as normal).'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a Commander game, combat damage you’re dealt by a commander is still tracked, even if it doesn’t change your life total.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can’t pay more life than you have, even if you won’t lose the game.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a white creature may become lethal if Celestial Crusader leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Sudden Spoiling affects only creatures the target player controls at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won’t change power and toughness or lose abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Sudden Spoiling overwrites any effects that set a creature’s power and toughness. Any existing effects or counters that raise, lower, or switch a creature’s power and/or toughness continue to apply to the creature’s newly-set power and toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After the last ability resolves, regeneration shields don’t apply if Knight of the Holy Nimbus would be destroyed for the remainder of the turn. This includes its own effect as well as regeneration shields from other sources.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Alternative costs, additional costs, and cost reductions don’t change a spell’s mana value. Its mana value is still based on its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s mana value.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If there’s somehow no color chosen for Paradise Plume, its middle ability can’t trigger and its last ability produces no mana. The former doesn’t trigger when colorless spells are cast and the latter doesn’t produce colorless mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities of the lands sacrificed may modify or trigger on the creatures being sacrificed and on the cards being discarded. Abilities of the creatures won’t modify or trigger on the lands being sacrificed, but may modify or trigger on the cards being discarded.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger while Smallpox is resolving will wait to be put onto the stack until Smallpox is done resolving.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As Smallpox resolves, first each player loses 1 life at the same time. Next, each player chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then all of the cards are discarded at the same time. Then starting with the player whose turn it is and proceeding in turn order, each player chooses a creature, knowing the choices made before them. All of the creatures are sacrificed at the same time, then finally repeat this process for lands.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger if Vesuvan Shapeshifter is entering the battlefield. Any "As [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[This creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied creature will also work. If a Vesuvan Shapeshifter becomes a copy of a creature after it\\\'s already on the battlefield, these abilities won\\\'t apply as Vesuvan Shapeshifter becomes a copy since it\\\'s not entering the battlefield; instead, any "As [this creature] is turned face up" or "When [this creature] is turned face up" abilities will apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a copied creature is a token that isn\'t a copy of something else, Vesuvan Shapeshifter copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it. Vesuvan Shapeshifter isn\'t a token in this case."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a copied creature is copying something else, Vesuvan Shapeshifter uses the copiable values of that creature. In most cases, Vesuvan Shapeshifter will copy whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If something copies Vesuvan Shapeshifter, the new copy will also have the triggered ability to turn it face down. However, once face-down, it won\'t have Vesuvan Shapeshifter\'s morph ability, so it can\'t be turned face up unless whatever it\'s copying also has a morph ability."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Vesuvan Shapeshifter copies exactly what is printed on the creature it\'s copying and nothing else (unless it\'s copying a creature that\'s copying something else or that\'s a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether a creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Most notably, if it copies a creature that\'s not normally a creature, it won\'t be a creature."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied land will trigger if Vesuva is entering the battlefield. Any “As [this land] enters the battlefield” or “[This land] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied land will also work.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Vesuva somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another land, Vesuva can’t become a copy of that land. You may choose only a land that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the copied land is copying something else, Vesuva uses the copiable values of that land. In most cases, Vesuva will be a copy of whatever that land is copying.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you don’t choose a land on the battlefield, Vesuva enters the battlefield untapped as itself, and will not be able to tap for mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Vesuva copies exactly what is printed on the land it’s copying and nothing else (unless it’s copying a land that’s copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether a land is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its types, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Faceless Devourer leaves the battlefield before its first triggered ability has resolved, its last ability triggers. This ability does nothing when it resolves. Then its first ability resolves and exiles the target creature indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Three Faceless Devourers entering the battlefield at separate times with no other creatures with shadow on the battlefield will result in an infinite loop. The game ends in a draw unless a player somehow interrupts the loop.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Fungus creature may become lethal if Thelon leaves the battlefield during that turn or if spore counters are removed from the Fungus during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Saproling may become lethal if Thelonite Hermit leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if you switch its power and toughness during that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Effects that switch a creature’s power and toughness apply after all other effects, regardless of when those effects began to apply. For instance, if you target a 1/2 creature then give it +2/+0 later in the turn, it’s a 2/3 creature, not a 4/1 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Switching a creature’s power and toughness twice (or any even number of times) effectively returns the creature to the power and toughness it had before any switches.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Draining Whelk’s ability counters the target spell even if you can’t put counters on Draining Whelk, most likely because Draining Whelk left the battlefield before the ability resolved.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target spell is an illegal target by the time Draining Whelk’s ability tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t put any counters on Draining Whelk. If the target is legal but the spell can’t be countered, you do put counters on Draining Whelk.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Dream Stalker’s ability doesn’t target any permanent. Because of this, no player may take action between the time you choose the permanent to return and the time you return it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You may return Dream Stalker itself to its owner’s hand as its triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s mana value.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Gorgon Recluse’s ability triggers when it blocks or becomes blocked by a nonblack creature and creates a delayed triggered ability that will destroy that creature at the end of combat step. It destroys that creature then even if Gorgon Recluse doesn’t survive that long or the creature somehow becomes black.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Hivestone doesn’t affect creature spells or creature cards anywhere other than the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Slivers are unaffected by Hivestone; a creature can’t have the same creature type twice.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Clockwork Hydra leaves the battlefield while its trigger is on the stack, you can’t remove a +1/+1 counter from it, so it won’t deal damage.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Clockwork Hydra’s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t remove a counter from Clockwork Hydra.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Mangara leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the target permanent is still exiled. Mangara won’t be exiled from the zone it’s in.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Mangara’s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t exile Mangara.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Phantom Wurm is dealt damage by multiple sources at once (most likely because it was blocked by multiple creatures in combat), all of that damage is prevented and you remove only one counter from it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect raises Phantom Wurm’s toughness so that it remains on the battlefield without any +1/+1 counters on it, Phantom Wurm’s ability prevents all damage that would be dealt to it even though you can’t remove a +1/+1 counter from it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is be dealt to Phantom Wurm, you still remove a counter even though the damage is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature attacks a planeswalker, that planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Slipstream Serpent’s first ability applies only while you’re declaring attackers. If it attacks while face down and then is turned face up, it’s still attacking even if the defending player controls no Islands.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell on the stack has split second while you control Teferi, you can’t suspend creature cards since split second stops you from casting them, even though suspending them is a special action.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell or ability lets an opponent cast a spell as part of its effect (such as suspend and rebound do), that opponent can’t cast that spell since the resolving ability is still on the stack. This is true even if the spell is an instant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect allows an opponent to cast spells any time they could cast an instant (for example, if your opponent also controls Teferi), the restriction of Teferi’s last ability takes precedence over that permission.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Teferi’s last ability means that in order for an opponent to cast a spell, it must be that opponent’s turn, during a main phase, and the stack must be empty. This is true even if a rule or effect allows a sorcery to be cast at another time.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'While you control Teferi, you may exile creature cards in your hand with suspend any time you could cast an instant.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell or ability copies Careful Consideration, the target player discards three cards for the copy after drawing four cards. This is because the copy wasn’t cast at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Looter il-Kor\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen in between, and no player can take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an attacking creature has multiple evasion abilities, such as shadow and flying, a creature can block it only if that creature satisfies all of the appropriate evasion abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Once a creature has been blocked, that creature remains blocked and will deal and be dealt combat damage even if it gains or loses shadow or if the blocking creature gains or loses shadow.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect copies Might of Old Krosa while it’s on the stack, the copy will give the creature only +2/+2, even if the original spell was cast during your main phase. This is because the copy is created on the stack and wasn’t cast at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Orcish Cannonade tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card, but you also don’t take 3 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast, the division can’t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Reiterate can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will resolve before the original spell does.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, you don’t reveal any cards.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You choose how many cards to reveal and which as Nightshade Assassin’s triggered ability resolves. Players can’t take actions between the time you reveal cards and the time the target creature gets -X/-X.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Bewilder tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Tendrils of Corruption tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain X life.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you control any tapped lands immediately after Nantuko Shaman enters the battlefield, its ability doesn’t trigger at all. If you control any tapped lands as the ability resolves, you don’t draw a card. Your lands could become tapped and then untapped again in between, however.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If your life total becomes 0 or less, you’ll lose the game before you can activate the ability of Children of Korlis.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The life you gain is based on the total amount of life you lost, not the difference in your life total from when the turn started. For example, if you lose 5 life and gain 3 life before activating the ability, the ability will cause you to gain 5 life, not 2.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you leave the game, the Forest you own leaves as well. If instead another player who received your Forest from Yavimaya Dryad leaves the game, that land is exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can be the target of Yavimaya Dryad’s triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Pendelhaven Elder’s ability affects only 1/1 creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn or that become 1/1 later in the turn won’t get +1/+2.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Pendelhaven Elder’s ability looks at each creature’s actual power and toughness taking into account counters and effects that raise or lower its power and/or toughness, not just its base power and toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Saffi can be the target of its own ability. In this case, the ability won’t resolve because its target is illegal, so Saffi won’t be returned to the battlefield, but any abilities that check when or if a creature dies will see that it died.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Saffi’s effect works only once. If the target creature dies and is then returned to the battlefield, it’s considered to be a new creature. If that new creature dies, it won’t come back.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The mana value of Lightning Axe is 1, no matter which additional cost you paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The size of the bonus is determined only as Tromp the Domains resolves. Once that happens, the bonus won’t change later in the turn even if the number of basic land types among lands you control changes.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Tromp the Domains affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t gain trample or get a power and toughness boost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Domain abilities count the number of basic land types among lands you control, not how many lands you control or how many of any type.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The basic land types are Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. Land types other than basic land types (such as Desert) don’t contribute to domain abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Strength in Numbers resolves. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of attacking creatures changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as the alternative cost of Snapback), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Urza’s is a land subtype that has no inherent rules meaning. Other effects may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When an echo ability of a permanent you control resolves, you may pay {0}, pay its echo cost, or choose not to pay (and then sacrifice that permanent). Any effects that check whether you paid the echo cost are satisfied if you paid {0} this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can activate Trespasser il-Vec’s ability as many times as you can afford to pay the cost, even if it already has shadow. Multiple instances of shadow on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can choose any card that Psychotic Episode instructs the player to reveal, even if that card was already revealed for another effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You choose whether or not to pay 2 life as the triggered ability resolves. You can pay 2 life even if Sangrophage is already tapped. (Doing so won’t cause Sangrophage to become untapped, however.)'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won\'t enter the battlefield with haste.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Undying Rage tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard from the stack rather than from the battlefield, so its last ability won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature of the chosen color may become lethal if Gauntlet of Power leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Gauntlet of Power is somehow on the battlefield with no color chosen for its first ability, no creatures get +1/+1 and its last ability never triggers. It still won’t affect colorless creatures or basic lands tapped for colorless mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Coal Stoker’s ability isn’t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If a nontoken creature enters the battlefield as a copy of this creature, the copy’s enters-the-battlefield ability will still trigger as long as you cast the spell that became that nontoken creature from your hand.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If a token is created that’s a copy of Coal Stoker, the token wasn’t cast, and Coal Stoker’s ability won’t trigger. Similarly, if an effect copies Coal Stoker while it’s on the stack, the copy becomes a token, but the copy was created on the stack and not cast from your hand, so the ability won’t trigger in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Griffin Guide and the enchanted creature go to the graveyard at the same time, Griffin Guide’s last ability will trigger.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Heiler aus D\'Avenant", \'text\': "{T}: Der Heiler aus D\'Avenant fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{T}: Verhindere den nächsten 1 Schadenspunkt, der in diesem Zug einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl zugefügt würde.", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein sorgfältig abgefeuerter Pfeil kann mehr Wunden verhindern, als ich heilen kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8dd19d-c6a8-443d-8faf-5f974b9e933b\', \'multiverseId\': 132900}, \'multiverseid\': 132900}, {\'name\': "Sanadora D\'Avenant", \'text\': "{T}: La Sanadora D\'Avenant hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\\n{T}: Prevén el siguiente punto de daño que se le fuera a hacer a la criatura o jugador objetivo este turno.", \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una flecha precisa puede prevenir más heridas de guerra de las que puedo tratar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f5e5b0-874b-4c6b-9031-5bf38ce4f6f0\', \'multiverseId\': 134405}, \'multiverseid\': 134405}, {\'name\': "Guérisseuse d\'Avenant", \'text\': "{T} : La Guérisseuse d\'Avenant inflige 1 blessure à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\\n{T} : Prévenez, ce tour-ci, la prochaine 1 blessure qui devrait être infligée à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc et archer\', \'flavor\': \'« Une flèche bien placée pourrait prévenir plus de blessures au combat que je ne puis en soigner. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132599&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b5fe0b-9818-46b3-9886-4a9acd7a9dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 132599}, \'multiverseid\': 132599}, {\'name\': "Guaritrice D\'Avenant", \'text\': "{T}: La Guaritrice D\'Avenant infligge 1 danno a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\\n{T}: Previeni il prossimo punto danno che verrebbe inflitto a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una freccia scagliata con prontezza potrebbe prevenire più ferite sul campo di battaglia di quante io ne possa curare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df90587-9bb6-49fe-9363-5da019ee7950\', \'multiverseId\': 133201}, \'multiverseid\': 133201}, {\'name\': \'アヴナントの癒し手\', \'text\': \'{T}：攻撃しているかブロックしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。アヴナントの癒し手はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このターン、次にそれに与えられるダメージを１点軽減する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・射手\', \'flavor\': \'狙いすまして撃たれた一本の矢が、私にできるよりも多くの戦場での傷を防いでくれることもあります。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f277d26-bbab-4c2e-ba41-cf0cce00de3f\', \'multiverseId\': 133502}, \'multiverseid\': 133502}, {\'name\': "Curandeiro D\'Avenant", \'text\': "{T}: Curandeiro D\'Avenant causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\\n{T}: Previne o próximo 1 ponto de dano que seria causado à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo neste turno.", \'type\': \'Criatura — Arqueiro Clérigo Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma flecha lançada com precisão pode prevenir mais feridas de campo de batalha do que eu poderia curar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf1b0a5-89ad-44ae-a1f0-bdc49d0b9aec\', \'multiverseId\': 133803}, \'multiverseid\': 133803}, {\'name\': \'Давнантский Лекарь\', \'text\': \'{T}: Давнантский Лекарь наносит 1 повреждение целевому атакующему или блокирующему существу.\\n{T}: Предотвратите следующее 1 повреждение, которое будет нанесено целевому существу или игроку на этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'«Одна меткая стрела может предотвратить больше боевых ран, чем я могу вылечить».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b74b154-87fc-4b6d-8296-81c03d4d5cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 134104}, \'multiverseid\': 134104}, {\'name\': \'阿维农治疗师\', \'text\': \'{T}：阿维农治疗师对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成1点伤害。\\n{T}：于本回合中，防止接下来将对目标生物或牌手造成的1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「强力射出一支箭的成效，或许比我在战场治伤还要来得卓著。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b9a342-3e4b-4947-8f63-b1fb34513c64\', \'multiverseId\': 132298}, \'multiverseid\': 132298}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Fendros keuchte, als er zusehen musste, wie der Zauberspruch aus seinen Fingerspitzen zu Boden tropfte. Er zog schnell seinen Fuß weg, um nicht unfreiwillig auf die Überreste zu treten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d93c5873-a9f6-48ab-b4b0-5c3b22f685f8\', \'multiverseId\': 132879}, \'multiverseid\': 132879}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Fendros tragó saliva mientras veía el hechizo deshacerse entre sus dedos. Movió su pie, temeroso de perturbar el lugar en donde cayó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9e5915-738a-4efc-8f6e-edf8296d453b\', \'multiverseId\': 134384}, \'multiverseid\': 134384}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Fendros manqua s\'étouffer quand il vit le sort lui dégouliner du bout des doigts. Il déplaça son pied, craignant de fouler l\'endroit où le sort avait péri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad1463e-9bb7-4e29-bf77-11a97b6cea64\', \'multiverseId\': 132578}, \'multiverseid\': 132578}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Fendros rimase a bocca aperta quando vide la magia gocciolare dalla punta delle sue dita. Spostò il piede, per paura di turbare il luogo dove giaceva morto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c016e2-86df-498d-8b2a-804df67e76ba\', \'multiverseId\': 133180}, \'multiverseid\': 133180}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'フェンドロスは、指の先から呪文が滴り落ちていくのを見てうめき声を上げた。 その屍が作った染みを踏むのを恐れ、彼は足をずらした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f233eb90-4787-4127-b3dd-53201099ffdc\', \'multiverseId\': 133481}, \'multiverseid\': 133481}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Fendros ofegou ao observar a mágica gotejando das pontas de seus dedos. Ele moveu seu pé, temeroso de disturbar o ponto onde jazia morto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0cc51ca-2236-4d82-81d6-6bb46b621d59\', \'multiverseId\': 133782}, \'multiverseid\': 133782}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Прервите целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Фендрос вздохнул, наблюдая, как заклинание стекло с конца его пальцев. Он двинулся в путь, боясь потревожить место, где оно безжизнено лежало.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48924e38-5840-4fa4-9eb0-131df54ce36a\', \'multiverseId\': 134083}, \'multiverseid\': 134083}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'范卓斯倒抓一口冷气，眼看着咒语从指尖无力垂落。 他移开一步，好让这早夭咒语得保安宁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8fa97f-a12c-4874-875a-3115da63fc45\', \'multiverseId\': 132277}, \'multiverseid\': 132277}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abweichler il-Dal\', \'text\': \'Irrealität (Diese Kreatur kann nur Kreaturen mit Irrealität blocken und nur von solchen geblockt werden.)\\nOpfere den Abweichler il-Dal zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments, falls du nicht {U} bezahlst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Sie lernen alles über die Taten ihrer verräterischen Ahnen und hoffen, in den Geschichten einen Hinweis darauf zu finden, wie sie wieder zurück in die richtige Welt kommen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f37da6-54eb-4c79-93ba-8f45c074fbc0\', \'multiverseId\': 132913}, \'multiverseid\': 132913}, {\'name\': \'Errante il-Dal\', \'text\': \'Se desvanece (Esta criatura sólo puede bloquear o ser bloqueada por criaturas con la habilidad de desvanecerse.)\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica el Errante il-Dal a menos que pagues {U}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Estudian las hazañas de sus ancestros traidores, esperando que la historia pueda revelar una manera de volver al mundo físico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b455c70-d39b-4537-bae2-a31c301ef7be\', \'multiverseId\': 134418}, \'multiverseid\': 134418}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond il-Dal\', \'text\': \'Distorsion (Cette créature ne peut bloquer ou être bloquée que par des créatures avec la distorsion.)\\nAu début de votre entretien, sacrifiez le Vagabond il-Dal à moins que vous ne payiez {U}.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Ils étudient les actions de leurs ancêtres traîtres, espérant que leur histoire leur révèlera un moyen de revenir au monde physique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132612&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af8c76b-2cf1-44eb-a80f-5fe7a68760e1\', \'multiverseId\': 132612}, \'multiverseid\': 132612}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondo il-Dal\', \'text\': "Ombra (Questa creatura può bloccare o essere bloccata soltanto da creature con ombra.)\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica il Vagabondo il-Dal a meno che non paghi {U}.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Studiano le gesta dei loro antenati traditori, nella speranza che i racconti possano rivelare un modo per tornare nel mondo fisico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78e0f7a-fe15-4216-83ef-cb1c8b24904e\', \'multiverseId\': 133214}, \'multiverseid\': 133214}, {\'name\': \'ダル追われの流れ者\', \'text\': \'シャドー （このクリーチャーは、シャドーを持つクリーチャーのみをブロックでき、ブロックされる。）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが{U}を支払わないかぎり、ダル追われの流れ者を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは裏切り者だった祖先のことを学び、そこから現実の世界に戻る術を見つけることを願っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4fc0f67-fa89-4321-bf60-a631aa377a51\', \'multiverseId\': 133515}, \'multiverseid\': 133515}, {\'name\': \'Errante il-Dal\', \'text\': \'Sombra (Esta criatura só pode bloquear ou ser bloqueada por criaturas com sombra.)\\nNo início de sua manutenção, sacrifique Errante il-Dal, a menos que você pague {U}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Eles estudam as ações de seus ancestrais traidores, na esperança de que as histórias possam revelar um modo de voltar ao mundo físico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d01eab3b-8ef4-431a-8263-653db4439dff\', \'multiverseId\': 133816}, \'multiverseid\': 133816}, {\'name\': \'Скиталец ил-Дал\', \'text\': \'Тень (Это существо может блокировать и быть заблокировано только существ(ами) с тенью.)\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки пожертвуйте Скитальца ил-Дал, если вы не заплатите {U}.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Они познавали дела их предательских предков, надеясь, что история откроет пути назад в физический мир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2577a257-5a4e-4608-b6ac-074fb84c036d\', \'multiverseId\': 134117}, \'multiverseid\': 134117}, {\'name\': \'达奥黜人漂泊者\', \'text\': \'次元幽影（此生物只能阻挡具次元幽影异能的生物，亦只能被具此异能的生物阻挡。）\\n在你的维持开始时，除非你支付{U}，否则牺牲达奥黜人漂泊者。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'他们研究叛逃先祖的事迹，希望从这些故事找出回到物质世界的方法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89bb5685-141e-41c7-99c1-0142affb2053\', \'multiverseId\': 132311}, \'multiverseid\': 132311}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amrou-Späher\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Rebellenkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kithkin, Rebell, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Der Krieg hatte das Volk von Amrou in alle Himmelsrichtungen verstreut und in Verstecke getrieben. Späher kümmerten sich um die Leuchtfeuer, die kommt und heim signalisierten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132857&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2690516e-cdca-48b5-93b6-bf29a0e72578\', \'multiverseId\': 132857}, \'multiverseid\': 132857}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora de Amrou\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Rebelde con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador rebelde kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'El pueblo de Amrou fue desperdigado por la guerra y obligado a esconderse. Los exploradores mantenían los fuegos de las almenaras que señalaban regreso y hogar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111eab89-6d34-4199-bc3d-12e2a9976960\', \'multiverseId\': 134362}, \'multiverseid\': 134362}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireuse amroue\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de rebelle avec un coût converti de mana de 3 ou moins et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sangami et rebelle et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "La population d\'Amrou fut éparpillée par la guerre et forcée à se cacher. Les éclaireurs attisaient les grands feux qui signalaient le retour et le foyer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7ff34d-3c93-4758-ae5e-d687b20187c2\', \'multiverseId\': 132556}, \'multiverseid\': 132556}, {\'name\': \'Esploratrice di Amrou\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Ribelle con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Ribelle Kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'La guerra disperse il popolo di Amrou e lo costrinse a nascondersi. Gli esploratori tennero vivi i fuochi di segnalazione che indicavano il ritorno a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e945ee98-a0af-4d05-b97b-31d71509dcd6\', \'multiverseId\': 133158}, \'multiverseid\': 133158}, {\'name\': \'アムローの偵察兵\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のレベル・カードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キスキン・レベル・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'アムローの人々は戦争で散り散りになり、隠れ住まざるをえなくなった。 偵察隊は「本国へ」と「帰れ」の信号の炎を炊き続けた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8f74f09-8040-4c00-bb3f-cbea8f488d1e\', \'multiverseId\': 133459}, \'multiverseid\': 133459}, {\'name\': \'Batedor Amrou\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Procure em seu grimório por um card do tipo Rebelde com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 3 e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Batedor Rebelde Kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'O povo de Amrou foi disperso pela guerra e forçado a esconder-se. Os batedores mantiveram suas fogueiras de sinalização que indicavam "retorno" e "casa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57742d4c-3253-4e28-9a44-8b7cf913ec74\', \'multiverseId\': 133760}, \'multiverseid\': 133760}, {\'name\': \'Разведчик Амру\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Поищите в вашей библиотеке карту Повстанца с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 и положите ее в игру. Затем перемешайте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кискин Повстанец Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Рассеянные войной люди Амру были вынуждены скрываться. Разведчики с нетерпением ждали сигнальных огней "обратно" и "домой".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0519469e-cf74-4969-a553-329aaa48e251\', \'multiverseId\': 134061}, \'multiverseid\': 134061}, {\'name\': \'安罗斥候\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用等于或小于3的反抗军牌，并将其放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～洁英／反抗军／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'安罗人民离散四方以避战火。 斥候则看守分别代表了「避难」与「返乡」的信标火焰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0fd55b-33c7-428b-8c36-568ac1432259\', \'multiverseId\': 132255}, \'multiverseid\': 132255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amrou-Sucher\', \'text\': \'Die Amrou-Sucher können nur von weißen und/oder Artefaktkreaturen geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kithkin, Rebell\', \'flavor\': \'Einst war Amrouhaven ein Paradies gewesen, jetzt war nur noch Asche übrig. Die Bewohner bemühten sich zu überleben und suchten Visionen der Vergangenheit in den seltsamen Stürmen, die schnell vorbeizogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132858&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1354301-2584-4bdb-94d0-c02677ca3626\', \'multiverseId\': 132858}, \'multiverseid\': 132858}, {\'name\': \'Buscadores de Amrou\', \'text\': \'Los Buscadores de Amrou no pueden ser bloqueados excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criatura blancas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rebelde kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'El paraíso del Refugio Amrou se convirtió en un campo de cenizas. Su gente lucha por sobrevivir, esperando ver visiones de su pasado en las extrañas tormentas que pasan rápidamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b527827-36e2-4d34-977d-a6672905ebc3\', \'multiverseId\': 134363}, \'multiverseid\': 134363}, {\'name\': \'Chercheurs amrous\', \'text\': \'Les Chercheurs amrous ne peuvent pas être bloqués excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures blanches.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sangami et rebelle\', \'flavor\': "Le paradis qu\'avait été le Sanctuaire d\'Amrou n\'était plus qu\'un champ de cendres. Son peuple luttait pour survivre, espérant retrouver des visions de son passé dans les étranges tempêtes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132557&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c41108-27e3-486a-942a-bb815eae71e1\', \'multiverseId\': 132557}, \'multiverseid\': 132557}, {\'name\': \'Cercatori di Amrou\', \'text\': \'I Cercatori di Amrou non possono essere bloccati tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature bianche.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ribelle Kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'Il paradiso del Rifugio di Amrou era diventato un campo coperto di cenere. La sua gente si sforzava di sopravvivere, nella speranza di scorgere visioni del suo passato nelle strane tempeste che passavano rapidamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22918033-dfa8-4f52-9837-67b213e6c68a\', \'multiverseId\': 133159}, \'multiverseid\': 133159}, {\'name\': \'アムローの求道者\', \'text\': \'アムローの求道者は、アーティファクト・クリーチャーでも白のクリーチャーでもないクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キスキン・レベル\', \'flavor\': \'アムローヘイヴンの楽園は消し炭の野と化した。 そこに住んでいた人々は、あっという間に過ぎ去っていった奇妙な嵐の中に浮かんだ過去の幻視を捕らえることを願い、必死に生き延びようとしていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd76ac2-4ed0-4b3d-a02e-48c23fd345cc\', \'multiverseId\': 133460}, \'multiverseid\': 133460}, {\'name\': \'Perseguidores de Amrou\', \'text\': \'Perseguidores de Amrou só pode ser bloqueado por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas brancas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rebelde Kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'O paraíso de Porto Amrou tornara-se um campo de cinzas As pessoas lutavam para sobreviver, na esperança de ter visões de seus passados nas estranhas tempestades que rapidamente se dissipavam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0802e6b8-ec68-4be6-8ae6-b324102e43af\', \'multiverseId\': 133761}, \'multiverseid\': 133761}, {\'name\': \'Исследователи Амру\', \'text\': \'Исследователи Амру могут быть блокированы только артефактными существами и/или белыми существами.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кискин Повстанец\', \'flavor\': \'Блаженные Небеса Амру превратились в поля золы. Этот народ боролся за выживание в надежде увидеть видения прошлого в чужих штормах, быстро проносящихся мимо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5f50898-a24f-40c1-b2f4-1697bb360544\', \'multiverseId\': 134062}, \'multiverseid\': 134062}, {\'name\': \'安罗追寻者\', \'text\': \'安罗追寻者只能被神器和／或白色生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～洁英／反抗军\', \'flavor\': \'曾如仙境的安罗庇护地已化为遍野灰烬。 其间人民挣扎求生，希望能见到奇异风暴中惊鸿一瞥的过往美景。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adda43fe-ccf3-4bb6-a260-eb4b4d90b7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 132256}, \'multiverseid\': 132256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anhängliche Lemuren\', \'text\': \'{0}: Die Anhänglichen Lemuren erhalten -1/-0 und Sumpftarnung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Lemuren? Sind das nicht so Äffchen? Endlich mal etwas harmloseres..." —Norin der Vorsichtige\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133140&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c1e1073-c755-4ee2-8859-7efc5aa28067\', \'multiverseId\': 133140}, \'multiverseid\': 133140}, {\'name\': \'Lémures viscosos\', \'text\': \'{0}: Los Lémures viscosos obtienen -1/-0 y ganan la habilidad de cruzar pantanos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Lémures? ¿Eso es todo? Al fin, algo inofensivo. . ." —Norin el Precavido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1088c374-a3a1-484d-bb1f-c8efccb7cbe1\', \'multiverseId\': 134645}, \'multiverseid\': 134645}, {\'name\': \'Lémurs visqueux\', \'text\': "{0} : Les Lémurs visqueux gagnent -1/-0 et acquièrent la traversée des marais jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Des lémurs ? C\'est vraiment tout ? Enfin des créatures inoffensives... » —Norin le circonspect", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b56018dc-23c7-4d3f-99fc-8d63bf078f19\', \'multiverseId\': 132839}, \'multiverseid\': 132839}, {\'name\': \'Lemuri Viscidi\', \'text\': \'{0}: I Lemuri Viscidi prendono -1/-0 e hanno passa-Paludi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Lemuri? Tutto qua? Finalmente qualcosa di innocuo . . ." —Norin il Diffidente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee9858d2-b933-4bde-9209-04035374f2b3\', \'multiverseId\': 133441}, \'multiverseid\': 133441}, {\'name\': \'粘つく霊命\', \'text\': \'{0}：ターン終了時まで、ヴィセリッドのヴィセリッドの霊命は－１/－０の修整を受けるとともに沼渡りを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'レミュー？ それしかいないのかい？ やっと無害なのが出てきたよ… … 。 ――二の足踏みのノリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa57499b-4ea9-45b3-86d2-92171bea455a\', \'multiverseId\': 133742}, \'multiverseid\': 133742}, {\'name\': \'Lêmures Viscosos\', \'text\': \'{0}: Lêmures Viscosos recebe -1/-0 e ganha travessia de pântano até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Lêmures? É só isso? Finalmente, algo inofensivo. . ." —Norin, o Cauteloso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee9ea4b-239d-44a4-9142-60fca5cdfa0c\', \'multiverseId\': 134043}, \'multiverseid\': 134043}, {\'name\': \'Прилипчивые Лемуры\', \'text\': \'{0}: Прилипчивые Лемуры получают -1/-0 и знание болот до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«Лемуры? И это все? Наконец-то что-то безобидное . . .» Норин Осторожный\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1186b2e-0d15-43c1-847b-57c6eb2c4b03\', \'multiverseId\': 134344}, \'multiverseid\': 134344}, {\'name\': \'黏滑游魂\', \'text\': \'{0}：黏滑游魂得-1/-0且获得沼泽行者异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「狐猴？ 就这样？ 终于有个无害的东西. . .」 ～谨慎的诺林\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15261534-b3a9-425c-ad97-bec0401c5df1\', \'multiverseId\': 132538}, \'multiverseid\': 132538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aschenpelzbär\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt spielen, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber spielen könntest.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'Die Bären trotten auf Nahrungssuche tief in die Risse im Zeitgefüge. Sie fürchten die Stürme nicht und sind auch schnell genug, um Beute zu reißen, die nur kurz in ihrer Zeit auftauchen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'976cc7ca-ca55-4a54-b240-89baf44b72df\', \'multiverseId\': 132862}, \'multiverseid\': 132862}, {\'name\': \'Oso manto de cenizas\', \'text\': \'Destello (Puedes jugar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras jugar un instantáneo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oso\', \'flavor\': \'Los osos vadearon las brechas de tiempo para alimentarse. No le temen a las tormentas, y son suficientemente rápidos para atrapar presas que destellan dentro y fuera del tiempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b198f85-dba9-456e-9948-7da3df8233fa\', \'multiverseId\': 134367}, \'multiverseid\': 134367}, {\'name\': \'Ours à fourrure cendrée\', \'text\': \'Flash (Vous pouvez jouer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez jouer un éphémère.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : ours\', \'flavor\': "Les ours s\'aventurent dans les failles temporelles pour se nourrir. Ils ne craignent pas les tempêtes, et ils sont assez rapides pour s\'emparer des proies qui surgissent du temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da07b63b-ca98-450e-b381-774169567f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 132561}, \'multiverseid\': 132561}, {\'name\': \'Orso dal Manto Cinerino\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi giocare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti giocare un istantaneo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orso\', \'flavor\': \'Gli orsi si aprono un varco negli squarci temporali per nutrirsi. Non temono le tempeste e sono abbastanza veloci da ghermire la preda mentre sfrutta le intermittenze del tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac7e4c8-f54c-4388-97f3-b55be3e37041\', \'multiverseId\': 133163}, \'multiverseid\': 133163}, {\'name\': \'灰毛皮の熊\', \'text\': \'瞬速 （あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントをプレイできるときならいつでもプレイしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'この熊は餌のために時の裂け目に飛び込んでいく。 嵐を恐れることはないし、時が瞬きする瞬間に獲物を捕まえる素早さも持っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90310597-f180-4706-bf19-c3e556817b38\', \'multiverseId\': 133464}, \'multiverseid\': 133464}, {\'name\': \'Urso Capa-Cinzenta\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá jogar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder jogar uma mágica instantânea.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Urso\', \'flavor\': \'Os ursos atravessam as fendas do tempo para alimentar-se. Eles não temem as tempestades e são rápidos o bastante para agarrar suas presas entrando ou saindo do tempo num piscar de olhos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c418c0-44bc-4370-a15a-28be33bab1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 133765}, \'multiverseid\': 133765}, {\'name\': \'Бледношкурый Медведь\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете играть это заклинание в любое время, когда вы можете играть мгновенные заклинания.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Медведь\', \'flavor\': \'Медведи преодолевали временные разломы в поисках пропитания. Они не боялись штормов и были достаточно быстры, чтобы охотиться на добычу, выскакивающую из самого времени.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e2e8a8d-d551-4913-9696-614c0f782204\', \'multiverseId\': 134066}, \'multiverseid\': 134066}, {\'name\': \'白毛熊\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够使用瞬间的时机下使用此咒语。）\', \'type\': \'生物～熊\', \'flavor\': \'这些熊蹚入时间裂缝觅食。 他们不怕其间风暴，并且有本事在猎物自时流进出的瞬间将之逮住。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2212cb7-85d1-490c-b128-1fe57fc6293a\', \'multiverseId\': 132260}, \'multiverseid\': 132260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Askari der glühenden Klinge\', \'text\': \'Flankenangriff (Immer wenn eine Kreatur ohne Flankenangriff diese Kreatur blockt, erhält die blockende Kreatur -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\n{2}: Der Askari der glühenden Klinge wird bis zum Ende des Zuges farblos.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Das kann doch nicht Jamuraa sein. Haben wir so gründlich versagt?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132871&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33907e38-9203-46af-87f7-eb15f1a872b1\', \'multiverseId\': 132871}, \'multiverseid\': 132871}, {\'name\': \'Askari de la Cuchilla Llameante\', \'text\': \'Flanquea (Siempre que una criatura sin la habilidad de flanquear bloquee a esta criatura, la criatura bloqueadora obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.)\\n{2}: El Askari de la Cuchilla Llameante es incoloro hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esto no puede ser Jamuraa. No podemos haberle fallado tanto. . . ."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb9c9d2-bedb-4853-a897-d9d331800f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 134376}, \'multiverseid\': 134376}, {\'name\': \'Askari de la lame brûlante\', \'text\': "Débordement (À chaque fois qu\'une créature sans le débordement bloque cette créature, la créature bloqueuse gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\n{2} : Askari de la lame brûlante devient incolore jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Ce ne peut pas être Djamuraa. Nous n\'aurions pas pu lui faillir de la sorte . . . »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be534a3f-4026-4c94-a8ed-e114926d78c9\', \'multiverseId\': 132570}, \'multiverseid\': 132570}, {\'name\': \'Ascari dalla Lama Rovente\', \'text\': "Aggirare (Ogniqualvolta una creatura senza aggirare blocca questa creatura, la creatura bloccante prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\n{2}: L\'Ascari dalla Lama Rovente diventa incolore fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa non può essere Jamuraa. Non possiamo averla disattesa così gravemente . . . ."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77690c62-163e-43a6-91c9-c08c87c21086\', \'multiverseId\': 133172}, \'multiverseid\': 133172}, {\'name\': \'炎の刃のアスカーリ\', \'text\': \'側面攻撃 （側面攻撃を持たないいずれかのクリーチャーがこのクリーチャーをブロックするたび、そのブロックしているクリーチャーはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。）\\n{2}：炎の刃のアスカーリは、ターン終了時まで無色になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'これがジャムーラのはずがない。 こんなにもこの地を失望させられるはずはないのだ … … 。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2797e90c-21b2-40c2-9fb6-1133968bba24\', \'multiverseId\': 133473}, \'multiverseid\': 133473}, {\'name\': \'Askári da Lâmina Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Flanquear (Toda vez que uma criatura sem flanquear bloquear esta criatura, a criatura bloqueadora receberá -1/-1 até o final do turno.)\\n{2}: Askári da Lâmina Flamejante torna-se incolor até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cavaleiro Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta não pode ser Jamuraa. Não poderíamos tê-la desapontado tanto assim. . . ."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771143d7-58b7-477f-937c-4660addb10e9\', \'multiverseId\': 133774}, \'multiverseid\': 133774}, {\'name\': \'Аскарский Храбрец\', \'text\': \'Обход (Когда существо без обхода блокирует это существо, это блокирующее существо получает -1/-1 до конца хода.)\\n{2}: Аскарский Храбрец становится бесцветным до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Это не может быть Джамура. Мы не могли так сильно ей проиграть. . . »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cb15d2f-ee55-48c3-ab04-ef0a88dd7e56\', \'multiverseId\': 134075}, \'multiverseid\': 134075}, {\'name\': \'辉刃阿斯卡力骑士\', \'text\': \'侧面攻击（每当一个不具侧面攻击之生物阻挡此生物时，该阻挡生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。）\\n{2}：直到回合结束，辉刃阿斯卡力骑士成为无色。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「这里不可能是杰姆拉。 我们不会让她衰弱到这地步. . . .」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae424555-7a91-4e4c-ba60-e35ea6cbedbe\', \'multiverseId\': 132269}, \'multiverseid\': 132269}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgestopfte Puppe\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Ausgestopfte Puppe ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Spieler.\\nDie Ausgestopfte Puppe ist unzerstörbar.\\nImmer wenn der Ausgestopften Puppe Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie dem bestimmten Spieler ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{T}: Die Ausgestopfte Puppe fügt sich selber 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'801daaa1-4ef8-4dd7-8374-1cc28a23a7e3\', \'multiverseId\': 133094}, \'multiverseid\': 133094}, {\'name\': \'Muñeca de trapo\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Muñeca de trapo entre en juego, elige un jugador.\\nLa Muñeca de trapo es indestructible.\\nSiempre que se le haga daño a la Muñeca de trapo, ésta le hace esa misma cantidad de daño al jugador elegido.\\n{T}: La Muñeca de trapo se hace 1 punto de daño a sí misma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6078342f-cdd9-4d36-a748-8aec5c333a26\', \'multiverseId\': 134599}, \'multiverseid\': 134599}, {\'name\': \'Poupée de son\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Poupée de son arrive en jeu, choisissez un joueur.\\nLa Poupée de son est indestructible.\\nÀ chaque fois que des blessures sont infligées à la Poupée de son, elle inflige autant de blessures au joueur choisi.\\n{T} : La Poupée de son s\'inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0bc5ae-7efb-401e-93ae-1272bfd66f6e\', \'multiverseId\': 132793}, \'multiverseid\': 132793}, {\'name\': \'Bambola di Pezza\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Bambola di Pezza entra in gioco, scegli un giocatore.\\nLa Bambola di Pezza è indistruttibile.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno alla Bambola di Pezza, essa infligge altrettanti danni al giocatore scelto.\\n{T}: La Bambola di Pezza infligge 1 danno a se stessa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'addab10d-95c9-49f1-a4cb-75ceecf92e28\', \'multiverseId\': 133395}, \'multiverseid\': 133395}, {\'name\': \'ぬいぐるみ人形\', \'text\': \'ぬいぐるみ人形が場に出るに際し、プレイヤーを１人選ぶ。\\nぬいぐるみ人形は破壊されない。\\nぬいぐるみ人形にダメージが与えられるたび、それはその点数に等しい点数のダメージを選ばれたプレイヤーに与える。\\n{T}：ぬいぐるみ人形は自身に１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e32e8f-16e3-4f23-bcb6-468996e8ac6f\', \'multiverseId\': 133696}, \'multiverseid\': 133696}, {\'name\': \'Boneco Empalhado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Boneco Empalhado entra em jogo, escolha um jogador.\\nBoneco Empalhado é indestrutível.\\nToda vez que for causado dano a Boneco Empalhado, ele causará aquela quantidade de dano ao jogador escolhido.\\n{T}: Boneco Empalhado causa 1 ponto de dano a ele mesmo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7154237a-ae11-4985-b170-151963fc6782\', \'multiverseId\': 133997}, \'multiverseid\': 133997}, {\'name\': \'Мягкая Кукла\', \'text\': \'При входе Мягкой Куклы в игру выберите игрока.\\nМягкая Кукла является неразрушимой.\\nКогда повреждения наносятся Мягкая Кукле, она наносит столько же повреждений выбранному игроку.\\n{T}: Мягкая Кукла наносит 1 повреждение самой себе.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98fd8bb-3e69-4c62-8deb-5bc5ecd74ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 134298}, \'multiverseid\': 134298}, {\'name\': \'填充娃娃\', \'text\': \'于填充娃娃进场时，选择一位牌手。\\n填充娃娃不会毁坏。\\n每当填充娃娃受到伤害时，它对该牌手造成等量的伤害。\\n{T}：填充娃娃对本身造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'940c4d25-d9ab-414a-b11f-35edf664df14\', \'multiverseId\': 132492}, \'multiverseid\': 132492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auskeimender Thallid\', \'text\': \'Lege zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Sporenmarke auf den Auskeimenden Thalliden.\\nEntferne drei Sporenmarken vom Auskeimenden Thalliden: Bringe einen 1/1 grünen Saprolingspielstein ins Spiel.\\nOpfere einen Saproling: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25b40cdf-d23f-426f-90cc-dbab970f2100\', \'multiverseId\': 133112}, \'multiverseid\': 133112}, {\'name\': \'Germinador tálido\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de espora sobre el Germinador tálido.\\nRemover tres contadores de espora del Germinador tálido: Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1.\\nSacrificar un Saprolín: La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3dc0d90-2c91-4e09-bed5-730ee69972e4\', \'multiverseId\': 134617}, \'multiverseid\': 134617}, {\'name\': \'Thallidé germinateur\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « spore » sur le Thallidé germinateur.\\nRetirez trois marqueurs « spore » du Thallidé germinateur : Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.\\nSacrifiez un saprobionte : La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37e81df8-a80c-45d1-b48c-6a22c3919446\', \'multiverseId\': 132811}, \'multiverseid\': 132811}, {\'name\': \'Thallid Genitrice\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino spora sulla Thallid Genitrice.\\nRimuovi tre segnalini spora dalla Thallid Genitrice: Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde.\\nSacrifica un Saprolingio: Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15bc0feb-84db-4929-b530-d06c572ddf35\', \'multiverseId\': 133413}, \'multiverseid\': 133413}, {\'name\': \'サリッドの発芽者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、サリッドの発芽者の上に胞子カウンターを１個置く。\\nサリッドの発芽者から胞子カウンターを３個取り除く：緑の１/１の苗木クリーチャー・トークンを１体場に出す。\\n苗木を１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbafcc14-8693-43a5-8c55-0a80f8d4e3c6\', \'multiverseId\': 133714}, \'multiverseid\': 133714}, {\'name\': \'Germinador de Talídia\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador de esporo sobre Germinador de Talídia.\\nRemova três marcadores de esporo de Germinador de Talídia: coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita.\\nSacrifique um Saprófita: A criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb99561e-5aec-4d13-9770-19d03ab399c1\', \'multiverseId\': 134015}, \'multiverseid\': 134015}, {\'name\': \'Проращиватель Таллидов\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, положите жетон споры на Проращивателя Таллидов.\\nУдалите три жетона споры с Проращивателя Таллидов: Положите одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг в игру.\\nПожертвуйте Сапролинга: Целевое существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed0a93d-1b9c-41fc-965d-63ad9bfa57df\', \'multiverseId\': 134316}, \'multiverseid\': 134316}, {\'name\': \'萌生散绿菌\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，在萌生散绿菌上放置一个芽孢指示物。\\n从萌生散绿菌上移去三个芽孢指示物：将一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生物放置进场。\\n牺牲一个腐生物：目标生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～真菌\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa208b7-0392-47b5-b3c8-47f8f553b357\', \'multiverseId\': 132510}, \'multiverseid\': 132510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basalremasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B}{B}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Faszinierend... In diesen Kreaturen findet man gleichzeitig die Hartnäckigkeit und auch die absichtliche Selbstzerstörung, die ich versucht habe, in meine Thrulls hineinzuzüchten." —Endrek Sahr, Meisterzüchter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e00871-5137-481a-b640-96fdf545c334\', \'multiverseId\': 132867}, \'multiverseid\': 132867}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado basal\', \'text\': \'Todos los Fragmentados tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {B}{B} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'"Fascinante. . . Estas criaturas tienen la paradoja de tenacidad y auto-destrucción premeditada que siempre intenté conseguir en mis thrulls." —Éndrek Sahr, criador experto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1fdd6d6-6e12-4bef-8b18-a8857a83bbff\', \'multiverseId\': 134372}, \'multiverseid\': 134372}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde fondamental\', \'text\': \'Tous les slivoïdes ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {B}{B} à votre réserve. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Fascinant . . . Ces créatures possèdent le paradoxe de ténacité et d\'auto-destruction que j\'ai toujours cherché à introduire dans mes srânes. » —Endrek Sahr, maître reproducteur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35619fd5-67e6-4458-b32f-c5270a059592\', \'multiverseId\': 132566}, \'multiverseid\': 132566}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Basilare\', \'text\': \'Tutti i Tramutanti hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {B}{B} alla tua riserva di mana."\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'"Interessante . . . Queste creature mostrano d\\\'avere il paradosso di tenacia e autodistruzione mirata che ho cercato di generare nei miei thrull." —Endrek Sahr, mastro allevatore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb41ca6-7aad-49a5-82e5-d71b2cc953ff\', \'multiverseId\': 133168}, \'multiverseid\': 133168}, {\'name\': \'基底スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}{B}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'面白いな … … こいつらの頑固さと自己犠牲という矛盾した性質は、私がスラルの繁殖で追い求めていることそのものだ。 ――繁殖の達人、エンドレク・サール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43c0950d-92dc-4dc9-88ef-35504d1a7c55\', \'multiverseId\': 133469}, \'multiverseid\': 133469}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Basal\', \'text\': \'Todos os Fractius têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {B}{B} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'"Fascinante. . . Essas criaturas exibem o paradoxo da tenacidade e autodestruição intencional que procurei criar em meus thrulls." —Endrek Sahr, criador mestre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71da635e-ec66-4f24-bb93-12c2d1a951fa\', \'multiverseId\': 133770}, \'multiverseid\': 133770}, {\'name\': \'Базальная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Все Щепки обладают способностью "Пожертвуйте это существо: Добавьте {B}{B} в ваше хранилище маны."\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'«Невероятно . . . Эти существа показывают парадоксальную живучесть и предрасположенность к самоуничтожению, которую я пытался привить моим труллям», Эндрек Сар, мастер-труллевод\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab9db581-60bc-4798-a9cb-321cb0acea3a\', \'multiverseId\': 134071}, \'multiverseid\': 134071}, {\'name\': \'立基裂片妖\', \'text\': \'所有裂片妖具有「牺牲此生物：加{B}{B}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「真了不起. . . 这些生物展现了生存韧性与自毁意图的吊诡结合，正是我为索尔兽育种所要达成的目标。」 ～培育师恩德瑞克·萨尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82bd2ea6-018e-46bd-ac34-765daf84354e\', \'multiverseId\': 132265}, \'multiverseid\': 132265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basaltgargoyle\', \'text\': \'FliegendEcho {2}{R} (Opfere zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments diese bleibende Karte, falls sie seit deinem letzten Versorgungssegment unter deine Kontrolle gekommen ist, falls du nicht ihre Echokosten bezahlst.)\\n{R}: Die Basaltgargoyle erhält +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d83647f-7623-419c-82fe-a1e45ce5502c\', \'multiverseId\': 132868}, \'multiverseid\': 132868}, {\'name\': \'Gárgola de basalto\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEco {2}{R} (Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si esto entró bajo tu control desde el comienzo de tu último mantenimiento, sacrifícalo a menos que pagues su coste de eco.)\\n{R}: La Gárgola de basalto obtiene +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gárgola\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c91976-9b1f-4153-83ca-2e73364d2278\', \'multiverseId\': 134373}, \'multiverseid\': 134373}, {\'name\': \'Gargouille de basalt\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÉcho {2}{R} (Au début de votre entretien, si ce permanent est passé sous votre contrôle depuis le début de votre dernier entretien, sacrifiez-le à moins que vous ne payiez son coût d\'écho.)\\n{R} : La Gargouille de basalt gagne +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gargouille\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e239a064-0ffc-4471-80e9-887d7e30e1be\', \'multiverseId\': 132567}, \'multiverseid\': 132567}, {\'name\': \'Gargoyle di Basalto\', \'text\': "Volare\\nEco {2}{R} (All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se questo permanente è entrato sotto il tuo controllo dall\'inizio del tuo ultimo mantenimento, sacrificalo a meno che non paghi il suo costo di eco.)\\n{R}: Il Gargoyle di Basalto prende +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df41d220-34b9-419e-b838-87c33d52f162\', \'multiverseId\': 133169}, \'multiverseid\': 133169}, {\'name\': \'玄武岩のガーゴイル\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nエコー {2}{R} （あなたのアップキープの開始時に、これが直前のあなたのアップキープの開始時よりも後にあなたのコントロール下になっていた場合、それのエコー・コストを支払わないかぎり、それを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n{R}：玄武岩のガーゴイルはターン終了時まで＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8e911a-5e50-4997-9300-83f0aaa15d47\', \'multiverseId\': 133470}, \'multiverseid\': 133470}, {\'name\': \'Gárgula de Basalto\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEco {2}{R} (No início de sua manutenção, se esta permanente passou a estar sob o seu controle desde o início de sua última manutenção, sacrifique-a, a menos que você pague seu custo de eco.)\\n{R}: Gárgula de Basalto recebe +0/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gárgula\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f32474-1eda-4e57-911b-7d6a7c4bb445\', \'multiverseId\': 133771}, \'multiverseid\': 133771}, {\'name\': \'Базальтовая Гаргулья\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЭхо {2}{R} (В начале вашего шага поддержки, если это существо попало под ваш контроль с момента начала вашего предыдущего шага поддержки, пожертвуйте его, если вы не заплатите его эхо-стоимость.)\\n{R}: Базальтовая Гаргулья получает +0/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гаргулья\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc57d08f-a7df-430e-9fe0-b1afedd13f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 134072}, \'multiverseid\': 134072}, {\'name\': \'玄武岩石像鬼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n返响{2}{R}（在你的维持开始时，若你在你前一个维持开始后才操控它，则除非你支付其返响费用，否则牺牲之。）\\n{R}：玄武岩石像鬼得+0/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df0a931c-7121-4030-9f72-f38251bf0332\', \'multiverseId\': 132266}, \'multiverseid\': 132266}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumvolk des Narbenwalds\', \'text\': \'Das Baumvolk des Narbenwalds kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'Im Zeitgefühl des Baumvolks vergehen Jahrhunderte schnell wie Stunden. Sie waren Zeitzeugen der Apokalypse, doch die ganzen Jahre waren für sie nicht mehr als ein missklingender, überaus zerstörerischer Moment.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed835691-2ae4-43ba-85b4-a809736282b6\', \'multiverseId\': 133063}, \'multiverseid\': 133063}, {\'name\': \'Pueblo arbóreo de Bosque tenebroso\', \'text\': \'El Pueblo arbóreo de Bosque tenebroso entra en juego girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'Para el pueblo arbóreo, las eras pasan como horas. Fueron testigos del apocalipsis, unos años que vieron pasar como un momento cacofónico ultra destructivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f05a2f84-4317-4ee1-bb3e-57ddecadc12e\', \'multiverseId\': 134568}, \'multiverseid\': 134568}, {\'name\': \'Sylvin de Brèchebois\', \'text\': \'Le Sylvin de Brèchebois arrive en jeu engagé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin\', \'flavor\': "Le sens du passage du temps est tel pour les sylvins que des âges leur paraissent des heures. Ils ont été les témoins de l\'apocalypse, des années qu\'ils vécurent comme un instant de cacophonie ultra-destructrice.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef006212-9d16-42ae-bbf8-b412df0a6467\', \'multiverseId\': 132762}, \'multiverseid\': 132762}, {\'name\': \'Silvantropo di Scarwood\', \'text\': \'Il Silvantropo di Scarwood entra in gioco TAPpato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': "Per la percezione del tempo dei silvantropi, i secoli sembrano ore. Sono stati testimoni dell\'apocalisse, i cui anni sono passati sotto i loro occhi come un unico momento cacofonico e iperdistruttivo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866a1778-2d43-44ca-8c0c-edc981170ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 133364}, \'multiverseid\': 133364}, {\'name\': \'スカーウッドのツリーフォーク\', \'text\': \'スカーウッドのツリーフォークはタップ状態で場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'ツリーフォークの時間感覚では、一世代は一時間のようなものだ。 彼らは最終戦争の証人とそこに立っている。その年月は彼らにとって、一瞬の極度に破壊的な不協和音のようなものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48276dbc-bbc7-45bf-ac30-4260334c3249\', \'multiverseId\': 133665}, \'multiverseid\': 133665}, {\'name\': \'Ent da Selva da Cicatriz\', \'text\': \'Ent da Selva da Cicatriz entra em jogo virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent\', \'flavor\': \'De acordo com a percepção de tempo dos ents, eras são como horas. Eles foram testemunhas do apocalipse, os anos que, na sua visão, foram como um momento cacofônico e ultradestrutivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d6f1e6-9875-43a7-a121-6bf4405ee99d\', \'multiverseId\': 133966}, \'multiverseid\': 133966}, {\'name\': \'Скарвудский Лесовик\', \'text\': \'Скарвудский Лесовик входит в игру повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лесовик\', \'flavor\': \'Из-за восприятия времени годы для лесовиков проходили как часы. Они стали свидетелями апокалипсиса тех лет, что они восприняли как мгновение страшного разрушения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c2cadfe-314c-49d1-8916-b50503a7cb28\', \'multiverseId\': 134267}, \'multiverseid\': 134267}, {\'name\': \'伤痕林树妖\', \'text\': \'伤痕林树妖须横置进场。\', \'type\': \'生物～树妖\', \'flavor\': \'对树妖的时间感而言，一甲子犹如数日。 他们耸立彼处见证末日战火，而那几年就像是令人不悦、饱含破坏的一刻。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8ac771-0202-47fc-896f-b1411e45c98a\', \'multiverseId\': 132461}, \'multiverseid\': 132461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befestigen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines Alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges; oder alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +0/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Da das Metall besudelt und Holz selten ist, bleibt uns der Glaube als starke Rüstung." —Tavalus, Tempeldiener von Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d146a45c-1700-4305-814b-5d1c734c195e\', \'multiverseId\': 132943}, \'multiverseid\': 132943}, {\'name\': \'Fortificar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno; o las criaturas que controlas obtienen +0/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Donde el metal está contaminado y la madera escasea, debemos armarnos con fe." —Távalus, acólito de Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47371d2e-de43-4f09-8880-a5071c74d2ef\', \'multiverseId\': 134448}, \'multiverseid\': 134448}, {\'name\': \'Fortifier\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour ; ou les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +0/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Quand le métal est corrompu et que le bois se fait rare, nous n\'avons pas meilleure arme que notre foi. » —Tavalus, acolyte de Korlis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132642&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2c38c4-7eae-46d8-a1d2-de25aaf45dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 132642}, \'multiverseid\': 132642}, {\'name\': \'Rafforzare\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno; oppure le creature che controlli prendono +0/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dove il metallo è corrotto e il legno raro, la nostra arma migliore è la fede." —Tavalus, accolito di Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde9189d-df5f-495a-ae76-6aaf05992b93\', \'multiverseId\': 133244}, \'multiverseid\': 133244}, {\'name\': \'補強\', \'text\': \'以下の２つから１つを選ぶ。「あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。」「あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで＋０/＋２の修整を受ける。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'金属が汚れ森林も稀なような場所では、信仰で身を固めるのが一番でしょう。 ――コーリスの見習い僧、タヴァラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e21dfa-8517-4c21-af83-63aa717f7271\', \'multiverseId\': 133545}, \'multiverseid\': 133545}, {\'name\': \'Fortificar\', \'text\': \'Escolha um As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+0 até o final do turno; ou as criaturas que você controla recebem +0/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Onde o metal está manchado e a madeira é escassa estamos melhor armados pela fé." —Tavalus, acólito de Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4dfcef-9528-4014-a2e1-ca24c9bf4c0d\', \'multiverseId\': 133846}, \'multiverseid\': 133846}, {\'name\': \'Подкрепление\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно Существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+0 до конца хода; или существа под вашим контролем получают +0/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Там где метал ржавеет, а дерева недостаточно, мы вооружимся нашей верой», Тавалус, служитель Корлиса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f493923e-1f5f-49b3-93f8-287668171f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 134147}, \'multiverseid\': 134147}, {\'name\': \'筑起工事\', \'text\': \'选择一项～由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束；或由你操控的生物得+0/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「金属腐坏，木材短缺，信念是我们最好的武器。」 ～寇利斯侍僧塔瓦勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae18b999-52b7-49a9-a8fb-f97f182ab3a6\', \'multiverseId\': 132341}, \'multiverseid\': 132341}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benalische Kavallerie\', \'text\': \'Flankenangriff (Immer wenn eine Kreatur ohne Flankenangriff diese Kreatur blockt, erhält die blockende Kreatur -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Volk hat geschworen, Benalia bis zum bitteren Ende zu verteidigen. Noch steht Benalia, und noch stehen wir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33079f68-dd18-4749-8a71-3aab98c62d4c\', \'multiverseId\': 132869}, \'multiverseid\': 132869}, {\'name\': \'Caballería benalita\', \'text\': \'Flanquea (Siempre que una criatura sin la habilidad de flanquear bloquee a esta criatura, la criatura bloqueadora obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi gente prometió proteger a Benalia hasta el fin. Está maltratada, pero todavía está aquí, al igual que nosotros."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'007e6ea8-4727-4e62-995a-0c40c4f67eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 134374}, \'multiverseid\': 134374}, {\'name\': \'Cavalerie bénaliane\', \'text\': "Débordement (À chaque fois qu\'une créature sans le débordement bloque cette créature, la créature bloqueuse gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Mon peuple a juré de protéger Bénalia jusqu\'au bout. Même blessée, notre contrée résiste, et nous aussi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132568&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f67f77b-9d52-4d58-a386-00bf1aa5bf37\', \'multiverseId\': 132568}, \'multiverseid\': 132568}, {\'name\': \'Cavalleria di Benalia\', \'text\': \'Aggirare (Ogniqualvolta una creatura senza aggirare blocca questa creatura, la creatura bloccante prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mio popolo ha giurato di proteggere Benalia fino alla fine. È stata colpita con violenza, ma è ancora in piedi, e così siamo noi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a4cd83-98c5-45eb-9c8e-6fc121b1f50f\', \'multiverseId\': 133170}, \'multiverseid\': 133170}, {\'name\': \'ベナリアの騎兵\', \'text\': \'側面攻撃 （側面攻撃を持たないいずれかのクリーチャーがこのクリーチャーをブロックするたび、そのブロックしているクリーチャーはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'ベナリアの人々は、最後までそこを守ることを誓っていた。 そこは度々襲われたが、未だ残っている。ならば我々もそれに倣おう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb8a638-fc5f-4dc6-aa87-36339e1d3ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 133471}, \'multiverseid\': 133471}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro de Benália\', \'text\': \'Flanquear (Toda vez que uma criatura sem flanquear bloquear esta criatura, a criatura bloqueadora receberá -1/-1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cavaleiro Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Meu povo jurou proteger Benália até o fim. Ela está arrasada, mas ainda está de pé, e nós também."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deda3a23-662d-47ca-a54d-245476a76761\', \'multiverseId\': 133772}, \'multiverseid\': 133772}, {\'name\': \'Беналишская Кавалерия\', \'text\': \'Обход (Когда существо без обхода блокирует это существо, это блокирующее существо получает -1/-1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Мои люди поклялись защищать Беналию до конца. Избито, но непоколебимо, как и мы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a325685c-5c1a-4a99-8633-bfec78faa7ee\', \'multiverseId\': 134073}, \'multiverseid\': 134073}, {\'name\': \'宾纳里亚骑兵\', \'text\': \'侧面攻击（每当一个不具侧面攻击之生物阻挡此生物时，该阻挡生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我城人民誓死保卫宾纳里亚。 城墙虽已破旧，依然屹立不摇；吾人亦如是。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6d0991-5743-4535-876b-dac71fec2db1\', \'multiverseId\': 132267}, \'multiverseid\': 132267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beobachtender Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris erhalten +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe sie beobachtetet, wie sie herumgezogen sind und Ausschau gehalten haben. Ich befürchte, sie interessieren sich für uns." —Yonat von Amrou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09fc4a4-cfb2-4f91-9ea2-d41183d8f329\', \'multiverseId\': 133144}, \'multiverseid\': 133144}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado observador\', \'text\': \'Todos los Fragmentados obtienen +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'"Los he espiado, observando y vagando, pero ¿buscando qué? Temo que nos observen." —Yónat de Amrou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82db8515-257b-4d07-833e-b64679e1002c\', \'multiverseId\': 134649}, \'multiverseid\': 134649}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde gardien\', \'text\': \'Tous les slivoïdes gagnent +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Je les ai espionnés, errant dans le monde, observant tout — Et que veulent-ils ? J\'ai peur qu\'ils nous guettent. » —Yonat d\'Amrou", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'920cdbca-4707-4ee8-bf0e-3d9524e4fb8c\', \'multiverseId\': 132843}, \'multiverseid\': 132843}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Osservatore\', \'text\': \'Tutti i Tramutanti prendono +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'"Li ho spiati, vagando e osservando—ma per cosa? Temo che ci sorveglino." —Yonat di Amrou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'039d8233-1e77-4a12-a0df-63a5a0072353\', \'multiverseId\': 133445}, \'multiverseid\': 133445}, {\'name\': \'監視スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは＋０/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'うろうろと見張ってるやつらを探ってたさ――でも、それが何になるんだ？ やつらが俺たちを見張るのが怖いよ。 ――アムローのヨナト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d65ab1f-2687-417c-a5eb-e9a336c703c8\', \'multiverseId\': 133746}, \'multiverseid\': 133746}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Observador\', \'text\': \'Todos os Fractius recebem +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu os espionei, vagueando e observando mas com que propósito? Tenho medo que eles nos procurem." —Yonat de Amrou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303bf921-bd97-43d4-98b4-652f7a27cb27\', \'multiverseId\': 134047}, \'multiverseid\': 134047}, {\'name\': \'Сторожевая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Все Щепки получают +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'«Я шпионил за ними, ползал и подсматривал но зачем? Боюсь, они наблюдают за нами», Йонат из Амру\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a06a16-c5b3-46d0-9dda-11488d928f36\', \'multiverseId\': 134348}, \'multiverseid\': 134348}, {\'name\': \'看守裂片妖\', \'text\': \'所有裂片妖得+0/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我窥探他们许久，不断地漂泊、监视～这是为何？ 因为我担心他们正监视着我们。」 ～安罗的尤纳\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bbb9ffb-b8ee-43c2-becf-a7f11d419e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 132542}, \'multiverseid\': 132542}]', "[{'name': 'Besuch in der Ewigkeit', 'text': 'Rückkauf Opfere drei Inseln. (Du kannst zusätzlich zu allen anderen Kosten drei Inseln opfern, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch spielst. Falls du dies tust, nimm diese Karte auf deine Hand, sowie sie verrechnet wird.)\\nEin Spieler deiner Wahl erhält nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133143&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97745c29-1ef8-4f78-afe0-df0cd82aff39', 'multiverseId': 133143}, 'multiverseid': 133143}, {'name': 'Caminar por los eones', 'text': 'Recuperar—Sacrificar tres islas. (Puedes sacrificar tres islas además de cualquier otro coste en cuanto juegues este hechizo. Si lo haces, pon esta carta en tu mano en cuanto se resuelve.)\\nEl jugador objetivo toma un turno adicional después de éste.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Teferi respiró hondo mientras preparaba el primero de una serie de golpes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134648&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2c26408-ff4e-4842-b70f-3292e3697230', 'multiverseId': 134648}, 'multiverseid': 134648}, {'name': 'Au travers des éons', 'text': 'Rappel — Sacrifiez trois îles. (Vous pouvez sacrifier trois îles en supplément de tous autres coûts quand vous jouez ce sort. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez cette carte dans votre main au moment où elle se résout.)\\nLe joueur ciblé joue un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132842&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9074d7c4-6765-451b-be08-26e9ae29b208', 'multiverseId': 132842}, 'multiverseid': 132842}, {'name': 'Attraversare i Secoli', 'text': 'Riscatto—Sacrifica tre Isole. (Puoi sacrificare tre Isole oltre a qualsiasi altro costo quando giochi questa magia. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano questa carta quando si risolve.)\\nUn giocatore bersaglio gioca un altro turno dopo questo.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133444&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89240e63-53fd-4061-9f0e-c6236ca388e8', 'multiverseId': 133444}, 'multiverseid': 133444}, {'name': '永劫での歩み', 'text': 'バイバック ― 島を３つ生け贄に捧げる。 （あなたはこの呪文をプレイするに際し、他のコストに加えて土地を３つ生け贄に捧げてもよい。 そうした場合、それの解決に際し、このカードをあなたの手札に加える。）\\nプレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、このターンの直後に追加のターンを得る。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133745&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11bef6db-aaad-43ad-82b3-fbe9f614d619', 'multiverseId': 133745}, 'multiverseid': 133745}, {'name': 'Caminhar nas Eternidades', 'text': 'Recuperar—Sacrifique três Ilhas. (Você pode sacrificar três Ilhas além de quaisquer outros custos ao jogar esta mágica.) Se fizer isso, coloque este card em sua mão quando for resolvido.)\\nO jogador alvo joga um turno extra após este turno.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134046&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '612bc10a-188a-40dc-869e-db525d56f797', 'multiverseId': 134046}, 'multiverseid': 134046}, {'name': 'Дорога Эонов', 'text': 'Выкуп Пожертвуйте три Острова. (Вы можете пожертвовать три Острова при игре этого заклинания. Если вы сделаете это, положите эту карту в вашу руку когда она разрешится.)\\nЦелевой игрок получает дополнительный ход после этого.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134347&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '089b7765-a1bb-4a1d-8b0d-2533fe510043', 'multiverseId': 134347}, 'multiverseid': 134347}, {'name': '步入万古', 'text': '购回～牺牲三个海岛。 （你使用此咒语时可以额外牺牲三个海岛并支付任何其它费用。 若你如此做，则结算此咒语时将它放入你的手牌。）\\n目标牌手在本回合后进行额外的一个回合。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132541&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcc4e85d-82e1-42a5-8ed9-02eb51d74ec7', 'multiverseId': 132541}, 'multiverseid': 132541}]", '[{\'name\': \'Beutejäger il-Kor\', \'text\': \'Irrealität (Diese Kreatur kann nur Kreaturen mit Irrealität blocken und nur von solchen geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn der Beutejäger il-Kor einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Da er Gegenstände von Wert nicht berühren kann, stiehlt er stattdessen Geheimnisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30b9218d-1164-474e-a56b-8387dbfa37a7\', \'multiverseId\': 132993}, \'multiverseid\': 132993}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador il-Kor\', \'text\': \'Se desvanece (Esta criatura sólo puede bloquear o ser bloqueada por criaturas con la habilidad de desvanecerse.)\\nSiempre que el Saqueador il-Kor haga daño a un oponente, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón kor\', \'flavor\': \'Imposibilitado de tocar objetos de valor, se dedicó a robar secretos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99dc4a4e-f3de-46f5-a56b-bd14c83ff4ce\', \'multiverseId\': 134498}, \'multiverseid\': 134498}, {\'name\': \'Détrousseur il-Kor\', \'text\': "Distorsion (Cette créature ne peut bloquer ou être bloquée que par des créatures avec la distorsion.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Détrousseur il-Kor inflige des blessures à un adversaire, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Incapable de toucher un objet de valeur, il s\'évertue à voler les secrets.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132692&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fac5170-ded5-4050-b525-20d40dcac983\', \'multiverseId\': 132692}, \'multiverseid\': 132692}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggiatore il-Kor\', \'text\': \'Ombra (Questa creatura può bloccare o essere bloccata soltanto da creature con ombra.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Saccheggiatore il-Kor infligge danno a un avversario, pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Kor\', \'flavor\': \'Incapace di toccare oggetti di valore, parte invece per carpire segreti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4c6c9ee-10ec-44ab-8a07-04d7c24519d3\', \'multiverseId\': 133294}, \'multiverseid\': 133294}, {\'name\': \'コー追われの物あさり\', \'text\': \'シャドー （このクリーチャーは、シャドーを持つクリーチャーのみをブロックでき、ブロックされる。）\\nコー追われの物あさりがいずれかの戦闘相手にダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'彼は金目のものには触れられないので、代わりに秘密を盗み出すことにしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f34f28-f4e4-4c99-8059-ed5054178cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 133595}, \'multiverseid\': 133595}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador il-Kor\', \'text\': \'Sombra (Esta criatura só pode bloquear ou ser bloqueada por criaturas com sombra.)\\nToda vez que Saqueador il-Kor causar dano a um oponente, compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ladino Kor\', \'flavor\': \'Incapaz de tocar itens de valor, ele sai para roubar segredos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae18695-5d81-4cc7-886b-f513e4757af4\', \'multiverseId\': 133896}, \'multiverseid\': 133896}, {\'name\': \'Грабитель ил-Кор\', \'text\': \'Тень (Это существо может блокировать и быть заблокировано только существ(ами) с тенью.)\\nКогда Грабитель ил-Кор наносит повреждения оппоненту, возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кориец Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Не имея возможности прикоснуться к ценностям, он бродил в поисках секретов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a56412-797d-4fc9-83b6-ff68cf66c9be\', \'multiverseId\': 134197}, \'multiverseid\': 134197}, {\'name\': \'寇族黜人掠夺者\', \'text\': \'次元幽影（此生物只能阻挡具次元幽影异能的生物，亦只能被具此异能的生物阻挡。）\\n每当寇族黜人掠夺者向对手造成伤害时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'既然贵重品无从得手，他转而窃取秘密。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0714296-dd1d-4c80-b810-6719d309f305\', \'multiverseId\': 132391}, \'multiverseid\': 132391}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasenkropf-Schlange\', \'text\': \'Die Blasenkropf-Schlange kann nicht angreifen, wenn der verteidigende Spieler keine Insel kontrolliert.\\nWenn du keine Inseln kontrollierst, opfere die Blasenkropf-Schlange.\\nMorph {5}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133075&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2261693a-ec16-4fd6-a0c2-fe81f291ed17\', \'multiverseId\': 133075}, \'multiverseid\': 133075}, {\'name\': \'Serpiente de la estela\', \'text\': \'La Serpiente de la estela no puede atacar a menos que el jugador defensor controle una isla.\\nCuando no controles islas, sacrifica la Serpiente de la estela.\\nMetamorfosis {5}{U} (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpiente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a498c37-b6d2-431e-8765-52caa804136b\', \'multiverseId\': 134580}, \'multiverseid\': 134580}, {\'name\': \'Serpent des sillages\', \'text\': "Le Serpent des sillages ne peut pas attaquer, à moins que le joueur défenseur ne contrôle au moins une île.\\nQuand vous ne contrôlez pas d\'île, sacrifiez le Serpent des sillages.\\nMue {5}{U} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)", \'type\': \'Créature : serpent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f752e21-48ae-4acf-a672-eacf26dece9c\', \'multiverseId\': 132774}, \'multiverseid\': 132774}, {\'name\': \'Serpe della Scia\', \'text\': "La Serpe della Scia non può attaccare a meno che il giocatore in difesa non controlli un\'Isola.\\nQuando non controlli Isole, sacrifica la Serpe della Scia.\\nMetamorfosi {5}{U} (Puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34186e9d-a218-487a-845a-a9b05e8dec24\', \'multiverseId\': 133376}, \'multiverseid\': 133376}, {\'name\': \'流水の海蛇\', \'text\': \'流水の海蛇は、防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしていないかぎり攻撃できない。\\nあなたが島をコントロールしていないとき、流水の海蛇を生け贄に捧げる。\\n変異 {5}{U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとしてプレイしてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3acb6b2-6c89-43d8-a658-1985bb759a65\', \'multiverseId\': 133677}, \'multiverseid\': 133677}, {\'name\': \'Cascavel do Turbilhão\', \'text\': \'Cascavel do Turbilhão não pode atacar, a menos que o jogador defensor controle uma Ilha.\\nQuando que você não controlar nenhuma Ilha, sacrifique Cascavel do Turbilhão.\\nMetamorfose {5}{U} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Vire sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e33eb9ed-00a4-4c67-98c8-dfea438f4b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 133978}, \'multiverseid\': 133978}, {\'name\': \'Инверсионный Змий\', \'text\': \'Инверсионный Змий не может атаковать, если защищающийся игрок не контролирует Остров.\\nКогда вы не контролируете Остров, пожертвуйте Инверсионного Змия.\\nОборотень {5}{U} (Вы можете играть это лицом вниз как 2/2 существо за {3}. Переверните его лицом вверх в любой момент за его стоимость оборотня.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Змий\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c601bc-b92b-49da-a984-29e2a03ea2df\', \'multiverseId\': 134279}, \'multiverseid\': 134279}, {\'name\': \'滑流巨蛇\', \'text\': \'除非防御牌手操控海岛，否则滑流巨蛇不能攻击。\\n当你未操控海岛时，牺牲滑流巨蛇。\\n变身{5}{U}（你可牌面朝下地使用此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。 可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01754c11-86de-4948-a4e3-a4fd5b01c326\', \'multiverseId\': 132473}, \'multiverseid\': 132473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blattern\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler verliert 1 Lebenspunkt, wirft eine Karte aus seiner Hand ab, opfert eine Kreatur und opfert dann ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Große Verlust führen meist nur zu einem betäubenden Schock. Um ein Opfer wirklich ins Unglück zu stürzen, musst du ihn viele kleine Verluste erleiden lassen." —Ratadrabik von Urborg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133076&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'462e9331-6320-4117-92f8-f799fa18b687\', \'multiverseId\': 133076}, \'multiverseid\': 133076}, {\'name\': \'Viruela\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador pierde 1 vida, descarta una carta, sacrifica una criatura y luego sacrifica una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Una gran pérdida lleva normalmente a un aturdimiento. Para verdaderamente hundir a una víctima en la miseria, debes abrumarla con muchos pequeños sufrimientos." —Rátadrabik de Urborg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befbee7e-acdb-495d-b326-73d2849de955\', \'multiverseId\': 134581}, \'multiverseid\': 134581}, {\'name\': \'Variole\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur perd 1 point de vie, se défausse d\'une carte, sacrifie une créature, puis sacrifie un terrain.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les pertes les plus dures ne sont qu\'un choc abrutissant. Pour faire plonger une victime dans la misère, il faut la submerger de petites souffrances. » —Ratadrabik d\'Urborg", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a236de50-6c18-439c-b5b6-fb6801cee01d\', \'multiverseId\': 132775}, \'multiverseid\': 132775}, {\'name\': \'Esantema\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore perde 1 punto vita, scarta una carta, sacrifica una creatura, poi sacrifica una terra.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Le grandi perdite spesso provocano solo un colpo inebetito. Per far veramente precipitare una vittima nella disperazione, devi sopraffarla con tante piccole sofferenze." —Ratadrabik di Urborg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a75d7820-997e-4578-a85e-ba913fe25f05\', \'multiverseId\': 133377}, \'multiverseid\': 133377}, {\'name\': \'小悪疫\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、カードを１枚捨て、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げ、土地を１つ生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大きな損失は、えてして衝撃を麻痺させるものだ。 犠牲者を真の苦痛へと追い詰めるのであれば、細かな苦痛を大量に浴びせなければならぬ。 ――アーボーグのラタドラビック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ee47cf-c94a-4921-8099-326d118d1cae\', \'multiverseId\': 133678}, \'multiverseid\': 133678}, {\'name\': \'Varicela\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador perde 1 ponto de vida, descarta um card, sacrifica uma criatura e então sacrifica um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Grandes perdas geralmente trazem apenas um choque entorpecido. Para realmente mergulhar a vítima em sofrimento, você deve sobrepujá-la com múltiplos pequenos sofrimentos." —Ratadrabik de Urborg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a2fd96b-e1b8-4fd0-abd7-76839f12e4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 133979}, \'multiverseid\': 133979}, {\'name\': \'Оспа\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок теряет 1 жизнь, сбрасывает одну карту, жертвует одно существо и затем жертвует одну землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Великие потери обычно приводят только к глубокому шоку. Для того чтобы повергнуть жертву в полнейшую нищету, вы должны ошеломить ее множеством мелких страданий», Ратадрабик из Урборга\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'000d51f2-0d4a-4ad1-88ad-1506c8b7f172\', \'multiverseId\': 134280}, \'multiverseid\': 134280}, {\'name\': \'小片毒疹\', \'text\': \'每位牌手失去1点生命，弃一张牌，牺牲一个生物，然后牺牲一个地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「巨大损失通常只教人惊呆。 要真正将人拉进痛苦深渊，必须用许多小型痛楚让他没顶。」 ～乌尔博格的拉塔札比\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b310b24-491c-412a-8217-d3a880f5acdd\', \'multiverseId\': 132474}, \'multiverseid\': 132474}]', "[{'name': 'Blick der Gerechtigkeit', 'text': 'Tappe als zusätzliche Kosten, um Blick der Gerechtigkeit zu spielen, drei ungetappte weiße Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\nEntferne eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nRückblende {5}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten und zusätzliche Kosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132949&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e4c6e55-0db9-47e9-97dc-72723a8c1922', 'multiverseId': 132949}, 'multiverseid': 132949}, {'name': 'Mirada de justicia', 'text': 'Como un coste adicional para jugar Mirada de justicia, gira tres criaturas blancas enderezadas que controles.\\nRemueve del juego la criatura objetivo.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{W} (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva y cualquier coste adicional. Luego remuévela del juego.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134454&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2c9d275-359c-4ea1-85b2-d71ffe72a314', 'multiverseId': 134454}, 'multiverseid': 134454}, {'name': 'Regard de la justice', 'text': 'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer le Regard de la justice, engagez trois créatures blanches dégagées que vous contrôlez.\\nRetirez la créature ciblée de la partie.\\nFlashback {5}{W} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback et ses coûts supplémentaires. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132648&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beb896cc-87ba-44ef-9e68-0896c4e9c158', 'multiverseId': 132648}, 'multiverseid': 132648}, {'name': 'Sguardo della Giustizia', 'text': 'Come costo addizionale per giocare lo Sguardo della Giustizia, TAPpa tre creature bianche STAPpate che controlli.\\nRimuovi dal gioco una creatura bersaglio.\\nFlashback {5}{W} (Puoi giocare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback e qualsiasi costo addizionale. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133250&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '677ba51f-6189-4169-b225-f2350bb69736', 'multiverseId': 133250}, 'multiverseid': 133250}, {'name': '正義の凝視', 'text': '正義の凝視をプレイするための追加コストとして、あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態の白のクリーチャーを３体タップする。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをゲームから取り除く。\\nフラッシュバック {5}{W} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストと追加コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。 その後それをゲームから取り除く）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133551&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8e4388a-1419-42a4-b71f-0735582fe359', 'multiverseId': 133551}, 'multiverseid': 133551}, {'name': 'Olhar da Justiça', 'text': 'Como custo adicional para jogar Olhar da Justiça, vire três criatura brancas desviradas que você controla.\\nRemova do jogo a criatura alvo.\\nRecapitular {5}{W} (Você pode jogar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação e quaisquer custos adicionais. Depois remova-o do jogo.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133852&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd9ac0cd-0ac0-433e-9bbe-1e68e0ae7404', 'multiverseId': 133852}, 'multiverseid': 133852}, {'name': 'Взор Справедливости', 'text': 'В качестве дополнительной стоимости для игры Взора Справедливости поверните три неповернутых белых существа под вашим контролем.\\nУдалите целевое существо из игры.\\nВоспоминание {5}{W} (Вы можете играть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость воспоминания. Затем уберите ее из игры.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134153&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45ed4711-625d-4317-bff1-6f3abe325667', 'multiverseId': 134153}, 'multiverseid': 134153}, {'name': '正义逼视', 'text': '横置三个由你操控且未横置的白色生物，以作为使用正义逼视的额外费用。\\n将目标生物移出对战。\\n返照{5}{W}（你可以从你的坟墓场使用此牌，并支付其返照费用与任何额外费用， 然后将它移出对战。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132347&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '559bda37-29ca-46a9-a37c-33b37b664bfd', 'multiverseId': 132347}, 'multiverseid': 132347}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blitzaxt\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um die Blitzaxt zu spielen, eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab oder bezahle {5}.\\nDie Blitzaxt fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Fleisch der Gargoyle kann mit einem normalen Hackmesser zerteilt werden, aber für die steinerne Haut..." —Asmoranomardicadaistinaculdacar, Kochbuch der Unterwelt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ad41c0-0728-45b6-8ea2-edd9734b2023\', \'multiverseId\': 132989}, \'multiverseid\': 132989}, {\'name\': \'Hacha de relámpagos\', \'text\': \'Como un coste adicional para jugar el Hacha de relámpagos, descarta una carta o paga {5}.\\nEl Hacha de relámpagos hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La carne de gárgola puede ser cortada con un cuchillo normal, si no fuera por su piel pétrea. . ." —Asmoranomardicadaistinaculdacar, Libro de cocina del infierno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a8f7ba-e4fc-4463-9f79-00da56b9f765\', \'multiverseId\': 134494}, \'multiverseid\': 134494}, {\'name\': "Hache d\'éclairs", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer la Hache d\'éclairs, défaussez-vous d\'une carte ou payez {5}.\\nLa Hache d\'éclairs inflige 5 blessures à la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La viande de gargouille peut être tranchée avec un hachoir tout à fait ordinaire, mais sa peau rocheuse... » —Asmoranomardicadaistinaculdacar, Cuisine du monde souterrain\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132688&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'783815f7-d6f9-49be-b878-6fb85fcce15b\', \'multiverseId\': 132688}, \'multiverseid\': 132688}, {\'name\': \'Ascia Folgorante\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per giocare l\'Ascia Folgorante, scarta una carta o paga {5}.\\nL\'Ascia Folgorante infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La carne di un gargoyle può essere affettata con una semplice mannaia, ma per la sua pelle pietrosa . . ." —Asmoranomardicadaistinaculdacar, Il Ricettario del Sottosuolo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebe6caee-e983-44c1-a5a9-4bfac9221142\', \'multiverseId\': 133290}, \'multiverseid\': 133290}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の斧\', \'text\': \'稲妻の斧をプレイする際の追加コストとして、カードを１枚捨てるか{5}を支払う。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。稲妻の斧はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ガーゴイルの肉は包丁でもさばけますが、岩のように固い皮膚の方は… … 。 ――地獄料理書、 アスモラノマルディカダイスティナカルダカール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f813342d-3f69-4b70-a7a8-dd3f336e1ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 133591}, \'multiverseid\': 133591}, {\'name\': \'Machado Relampejante\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para jogar Machado Relampejante, descarte um card ou pague {5}.\\nMachado Relampejante causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A carne de uma Gárgula pode ser cinzelada com uma machadinha comum, mas no caso de sua pele pedregosa. . ." —Asmoranomardicadaistinaculdacar, Livro de Receitas do Submundo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5a2d90-f1ad-4919-bfdb-01b41ff88a24\', \'multiverseId\': 133892}, \'multiverseid\': 133892}, {\'name\': \'Топор Молний\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости для игры Топора Молний сбросьте карту или заплатите {5}.\\nТопор Молний наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мясо гарголии можно вырезать обычным секачем, но их затвердевшая кожа . . .» Асмораномардикадайстинакулдакар, Поваренная книга Преисподней\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e1affd-10ea-4065-96a3-ae645d5de4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 134193}, \'multiverseid\': 134193}, {\'name\': \'闪电斧\', \'text\': \'你可以弃一张牌或支付{5}，以作为使用闪电斧的额外费用。\\n闪电斧对目标生物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「石像鬼的肉可以用一般的切肉刀削开，至于他的石皮. . .」 ～阿司魔拉诺马尔迪卡带斯提纳酷达卡， 地底世界食谱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b5354b3-c119-4bc3-bd50-61cd48458e64\', \'multiverseId\': 132387}, \'multiverseid\': 132387}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutfresser\', \'text\': \'Tappe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments den Blutfresser, falls du nicht 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Er isst nur lebende Sachen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7fa8b45-cf06-452e-ace9-aad9b3618ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 133061}, \'multiverseid\': 133061}, {\'name\': \'Sangrófago\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, gira el Sangrófago a menos que pagues 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Sólo se alimenta de los vivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d773b1ef-504e-437f-8f00-4543e7d2a9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 134566}, \'multiverseid\': 134566}, {\'name\': \'Sangrophage\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, engagez le Sangrophage à moins que vous ne payiez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Il ne dévore que la vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27867a6-6266-4cbe-8a5b-42acc7fbcc27\', \'multiverseId\': 132760}, \'multiverseid\': 132760}, {\'name\': \'Ematofago\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, TAPpa l\'Ematofago a meno che non paghi 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'I vivi sono tutto ciò che mangia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c03867d-68c9-47a4-ae71-9b1d51c13804\', \'multiverseId\': 133362}, \'multiverseid\': 133362}, {\'name\': \'サングロファージ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが２点のライフを支払わないかぎり、サングロファージをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'生きものはすべて食いもの。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d500a55-f14c-4216-8fb2-471ef3967af9\', \'multiverseId\': 133663}, \'multiverseid\': 133663}, {\'name\': \'Sanguinófago\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, vire Sanguinófago, a menos que você pague 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Os vivos são a única coisa que ele come.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7e4d58-e857-4919-9ba1-5b8b0995b98d\', \'multiverseId\': 133964}, \'multiverseid\': 133964}, {\'name\': \'Пожиратель Крови\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки поверните Пожирателя Крови, если вы не заплатите 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Все живое это то, что оно ест.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cde2c0e-6a0c-445a-82c2-bf0dc4106de1\', \'multiverseId\': 134265}, \'multiverseid\': 134265}, {\'name\': \'血饮非\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，除非你支付2点生命，否则横置血饮非。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'活的它都吃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4809cbff-2ccb-40c1-90f7-b646d3b26ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 132459}, \'multiverseid\': 132459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blühende Umarmung\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3 und „Bringe zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Spielstein unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel".\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133135&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2deb03-30da-47b4-9e45-a2ec90e931c1\', \'multiverseId\': 133135}, \'multiverseid\': 133135}, {\'name\': \'Abrazo verde\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3 y tiene "Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, pon en juego bajo tu control una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f4bd1f-4557-4698-ab2c-9c1d777cd768\', \'multiverseId\': 134640}, \'multiverseid\': 134640}, {\'name\': \'Étreinte verdoyante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3 et a « Au début de chaque entretien, mettez en jeu, sous votre contrôle, un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'013406b3-06bd-4363-a6b1-26c72e53f5b6\', \'multiverseId\': 132834}, \'multiverseid\': 132834}, {\'name\': \'Abbraccio della Vegetazione\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3 e ha "All\\\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, metti in gioco una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde sotto il tuo controllo."\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'736c74e8-1d4b-4c24-bfc9-b3df7f19fe5d\', \'multiverseId\': 133436}, \'multiverseid\': 133436}, {\'name\': \'新緑の抱擁\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋３/＋３の修整を受けるとともに「各アップキープの開始時に、緑の１/１の苗木クリーチャー・トークンを１体、あなたのコントロール下で場に出す。」の能力を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23275a6-c910-45a8-b71a-5f7740a451a8\', \'multiverseId\': 133737}, \'multiverseid\': 133737}, {\'name\': \'Abraço Verdejante\', \'text\': \'Encantar Criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3 e tem "No início de cada manutenção, coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita sob seu controle."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8108ac78-26c6-48e6-914e-4a1264c25f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 134038}, \'multiverseid\': 134038}, {\'name\': \'Зеленое Объятье\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3 и обладает способностью "В начале каждого шага поддержки, положите одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг в игру под вашим контролем."\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2009880-c4ee-4bdf-a1b2-e0679cb44f10\', \'multiverseId\': 134339}, \'multiverseid\': 134339}, {\'name\': \'新绿之拥\', \'text\': \'生物结界\\n受此结界的生物得+3/+3并具有「在每个维持开始时，将一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生物在你的操控下放置进场。」\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a529315-e8ac-4a37-87b1-2de5117c3ba6\', \'multiverseId\': 132533}, \'multiverseid\': 132533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodenspalt\', \'text\': \'Eine nichtfliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Risse im Zeitgefüge sogen nicht die Menschen ein, sondern den Grund und Boden, auf dem sie standen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e357246f-2636-4ee7-9a91-785c6510087b\', \'multiverseId\': 132961}, \'multiverseid\': 132961}, {\'name\': \'Grieta en el terreno\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo sin la habilidad de volar no puede bloquear este turno.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunas brechas de tiempo no se llevaron gente, sino simplemente el suelo sobre el que estaban parados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'574a9cb7-b771-479b-875b-e1ab1d643ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 134466}, \'multiverseid\': 134466}, {\'name\': \'Faille terrestre\', \'text\': \'La créature sans le vol ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Certaines failles temporelles n\'aspiraient pas les gens, mais le sol qu\'ils foulaient.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132660&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8618ae76-6bcd-4eb6-b6cd-2eb68ea9b6a3\', \'multiverseId\': 132660}, \'multiverseid\': 132660}, {\'name\': \'Fenditura nel Terreno\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio senza volare non può bloccare in questo turno.\\nTempesta (Quando giochi questa magia, copiala per ogni magia giocata prima in questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni squarci temporali non portavano via le persone ma il terreno su cui si trovavano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de7301ed-52e5-4822-a7d3-3629d58b76fd\', \'multiverseId\': 133262}, \'multiverseid\': 133262}, {\'name\': \'大地の裂け目\', \'text\': \'飛行を持たないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックできない。\\nストーム （あなたがこの呪文をプレイしたとき、それを、このターンそれより前にプレイされていた呪文の総数に等しい回数だけコピーする。 あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'時の裂け目の中には、人々ではなく彼らが立つ大地を消し去るものがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ec9e30-e660-4b69-843a-fd3cf2554607\', \'multiverseId\': 133563}, \'multiverseid\': 133563}, {\'name\': \'Fenda do Solo\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo sem voar não pode bloquear neste turno.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas fendas do tempo não levaram embora as pessoas, mas apenas o chão em que pisavam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7961e49f-4a87-4b73-8029-96c6a6d2f9ea\', \'multiverseId\': 133864}, \'multiverseid\': 133864}, {\'name\': \'Великий Разлом\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо без Полета не может блокировать на этом ходу.\\nШторм (Когда вы играете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое сыгранное в этом ходу заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для этих копий.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые временные разломы не трогали людей, а забирали лишь только земли, на которых они появлялись.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4442ce0a-7e5b-48de-b975-847183217f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 134165}, \'multiverseid\': 134165}, {\'name\': \'迸地\', \'text\': \'目标不具飞行异能的生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n风暴（当你使用此咒语时，本回合于它之前每使用过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。） 你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些时间裂缝不会将人带走，而是改换其所立大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5fb135-367f-48f2-943d-b53b2c30832e\', \'multiverseId\': 132359}, \'multiverseid\': 132359}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanischer Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt spielen, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber spielen könntest.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Bogardanische Höllendrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er 5 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73b9efea-6349-4b25-9ae8-5babc5480811\', \'multiverseId\': 132872}, \'multiverseid\': 132872}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Destello (Puedes jugar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras jugar un instantáneo.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Engendro de Bogardan entre en juego, hace 5 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier número de criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b40c86-780d-4581-8d08-2b2b46ff24c0\', \'multiverseId\': 134377}, \'multiverseid\': 134377}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez jouer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez jouer un éphémère.)\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer du Bogardân arrive en jeu, il inflige 5 blessures réparties comme vous le voulez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0efcbf7-afbb-488e-8b74-02ef8e5d6c04\', \'multiverseId\': 132571}, \'multiverseid\': 132571}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi giocare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti giocare un istantaneo.)\\nVolare\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan entra in gioco, infligge 5 danni suddivisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c67160-32b4-408c-a14e-66f693eba47f\', \'multiverseId\': 133173}, \'multiverseid\': 133173}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンのヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'瞬速 （あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントをプレイできるときならいつでもプレイしてよい。）\\n飛行\\nボガーダンのヘルカイトが場に出たとき、望む数のクリーチャーかプレイヤー（またはその組み合わせ）を対象とする。ボガーダンのヘルカイトは、それらに５点のダメージを好きなように割り振って与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d3e87a-47e6-4775-97b6-e67c50d9903d\', \'multiverseId\': 133474}, \'multiverseid\': 133474}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá jogar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder jogar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nVoar\\nQuando Dragão Avérneo de Bogardan entra em jogo, ele causa 5 pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre qualquer número de criaturas alvos e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4f9ec8-7b6b-44d6-b4c8-93f71e06468f\', \'multiverseId\': 133775}, \'multiverseid\': 133775}, {\'name\': \'Богарданский Змей\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете играть это заклинание в любое время, когда вы можете играть мгновенные заклинания.)\\nПолет\\nКогда Богарданский Змей входит в игру, он наносит 5 повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между любым числом целевых существ и/или игроков.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334b139f-1d88-4386-a3f2-16c1f5717692\', \'multiverseId\': 134076}, \'multiverseid\': 134076}, {\'name\': \'博卡登残虐者\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够使用瞬间的时机下使用此咒语。）\\n飞行\\n当博卡登残虐者进场时，它对任意数量的目标生物和／或牌手造成共5点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f45133-25c6-4458-a6ba-559c36385f85\', \'multiverseId\': 132270}, \'multiverseid\': 132270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanischer Wüterich\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt spielen, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber spielen könntest.)\\nWenn der Bogardanische Wüterich ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +4/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Im von Vulkanausbrüchen geprägten Herz von Bogardan ist es oft schwer zu sagen, ob man gerade herumfliegendes Vulkangestein oder herumspringende Vulkanmonster sieht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c81d65c-57cb-4616-815d-959fa13f3478\', \'multiverseId\': 132873}, \'multiverseid\': 132873}, {\'name\': \'Iracundo de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Destello (Puedes jugar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras jugar un instantáneo.)\\nCuando el Iracundo de Bogardan entre en juego, la criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'En el corazón en erupción de Bogardan, es difícil diferenciar rocas volcánicas volando de bestias volcánicas saltando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9690ef-8f00-40dc-bbcb-212c8bc88cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 134378}, \'multiverseid\': 134378}, {\'name\': \'Furie du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez jouer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez jouer un éphémère.)\\nQuand la Furie du Bogardân arrive en jeu, la créature ciblée gagne +4/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'Dans les éruptions du Bogardân, il est difficile de distinguer les pierres incandescentes des bêtes volcaniques bondissantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132572&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d253a1b-c937-4ffb-9504-3f46645eac29\', \'multiverseId\': 132572}, \'multiverseid\': 132572}, {\'name\': \'Furia di Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi giocare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti giocare un istantaneo.)\\nQuando la Furia di Bogardan entra in gioco, una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': "Nel cuore dell\'eruzione di Bogardan è difficile distinguere tra saettanti rocce vulcaniche e guizzanti bestie vulcaniche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae12984-c981-45b5-8a70-e38367b34874\', \'multiverseId\': 133174}, \'multiverseid\': 133174}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンの憤怒獣\', \'text\': \'瞬速 （あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントをプレイできるときならいつでもプレイしてよい。）\\nボガーダンの憤怒獣が場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋４/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'噴火し続けるボガーダンの中心では、激しくぶつかる火山弾と飛び回る火山の獣とを見分けるのは難しい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f769b4-6f9d-44ed-b283-a7e84a3b8218\', \'multiverseId\': 133475}, \'multiverseid\': 133475}, {\'name\': \'Raivoso de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá jogar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder jogar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nQuando Raivoso de Bogardan entra em jogo, a criatura alvo recebe +4/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'No coração em erupção de Bogardan, é difícil distinguir entre rochas vulcânicas voadoras e bestas vulcânicas agressoras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b40be7f-2925-4084-98f7-940986208e6a\', \'multiverseId\': 133776}, \'multiverseid\': 133776}, {\'name\': \'Богарданское Неистовство\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете играть это заклинание в любое время, когда вы можете играть мгновенные заклинания.)\\nКогда Богарданское Неистовство входит в игру, целевое существо получает +4/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'В клокочущем сердце Богардана очень трудно попросить громыхающие камни не бить вулканических зверей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210ad967-0cee-4051-bd54-843f864ea24e\', \'multiverseId\': 134077}, \'multiverseid\': 134077}, {\'name\': \'博卡登狂兽\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够使用瞬间的时机下使用此咒语。）\\n当博卡登狂兽进场时，目标生物得+4/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'在翻腾不已的博卡登之心，你很难辨别哪个是飞掠而过的火山岩，哪个又是直扑而来的火山兽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2150e184-42e1-42f1-9486-ae96d2c05fd3\', \'multiverseId\': 132271}, \'multiverseid\': 132271}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandschatzen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\\nAussetzen 4 {1}{R} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu spielen, kannst du {1}{R} bezahlen, sie ganz aus dem Spiel entfernen und vier Zeitmarken auf sie legen. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn du die letzte Zeitmarke entfernst, spiele die Karte, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133044&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f33f9bb-772c-48bb-9654-be01b2985f90\', \'multiverseId\': 133044}, \'multiverseid\': 133044}, {\'name\': \'Saquear\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\\nSuspender 4—{1}{R} (En lugar de jugar esta carta de tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{R} y removerla del juego con cuatro contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, juégala sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef17b959-f4cb-4873-98bd-7ce6cb67b09e\', \'multiverseId\': 134549}, \'multiverseid\': 134549}, {\'name\': \'Saccagement\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.\\nSuspension 4 — {1}{R} (Plutôt que jouer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{R} et la retirer de la partie avec quatre marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand vous retirez le dernier, jouez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f13944-c51e-43aa-a2de-da840ac26415\', \'multiverseId\': 132743}, \'multiverseid\': 132743}, {\'name\': \'Razziare\', \'text\': "Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\\nSospendere 4—{1}{R} (Invece di giocare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {1}{R} e rimuoverla dal gioco con quattro segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando rimuovi l\'ultimo, gioca la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48d312dd-9876-44c9-a2f7-d9dcf29ce357\', \'multiverseId\': 133345}, \'multiverseid\': 133345}, {\'name\': \'略取\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n待機 ４―{1}{R} （これをあなたの手札からプレイするのではなく、{1}{R}を支払ってゲームから取り除き、その上に時間カウンターを４個置いてもよい。 あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。 最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払わずにプレイする。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13b0c9d-3f25-4d04-ba16-351fd8049181\', \'multiverseId\': 133646}, \'multiverseid\': 133646}, {\'name\': \'Saquear\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo ou o terreno alvo.\\nSuspender 4—{1}{R} (Em vez de jogar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {1}{R} e removê-lo do jogo com quatro marcadores temporais sobre ele. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando remover o último, jogue-o sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'856738c1-19a1-4999-8b90-2409fa50b70a\', \'multiverseId\': 133947}, \'multiverseid\': 133947}, {\'name\': \'Разорение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или землю.\\nОтсрочка 4—{1}{R} (Вместо того чтобы сыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {1}{R} и удалить ее из игры с четырьмя временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда вы удалите последний, сыграйте эту карту без оплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09d5adf-0473-4acd-a074-d2c4d25dfa95\', \'multiverseId\': 134248}, \'multiverseid\': 134248}, {\'name\': \'劫夺\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。\\n延缓4～{1}{R}（除了从你手上使用此牌，你可以支付{1}{R}并将此牌移出对战，且上面有四个计时指示物。 在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。 当你移去最后一个时，则使用它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37a8aa3-fdcd-41d8-9a16-6bcc2849ef88\', \'multiverseId\': 132442}, \'multiverseid\': 132442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennende Erinnerungen\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt eine zufällig bestimmte Karte aus seiner Hand offen vor. Brennende Erinnerungen fügen diesem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten dieser Karte zu.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5b67ce-e284-43d2-9c02-e65c0423fcff\', \'multiverseId\': 132971}, \'multiverseid\': 132971}, {\'name\': \'Encender los recuerdos\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra una carta al azar de su mano. Encender los recuerdos hace daño a ese jugador igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f0809b-b6f4-44fa-8b57-cde0adef936b\', \'multiverseId\': 134476}, \'multiverseid\': 134476}, {\'name\': \'Embrasement des souvenirs\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé révèle au hasard une carte de sa main. L\'Embrasement des souvenirs inflige à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de cette carte.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132670&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89b0976-33f2-4f23-8643-fb4360e41bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 132670}, \'multiverseid\': 132670}, {\'name\': \'Infiammare i Ricordi\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio rivela una carta a caso dalla propria mano. Infiammare i Ricordi infligge a quel giocatore un ammontare di danni pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta.\\nTempesta (Quando giochi questa magia, copiala per ogni magia giocata prima in questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7468da-1420-4335-abda-6cb90d0cf34a\', \'multiverseId\': 133272}, \'multiverseid\': 133272}, {\'name\': \'記憶の点火\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは手札からカードを１枚無作為に選んで公開する。 記憶の点火はそのプレイヤーに、そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\nストーム （あなたがこの呪文をプレイしたとき、それを、このターンそれより前にプレイされていた呪文の総数に等しい回数だけコピーする。 あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880cc73d-426f-4406-93da-e4bb0e156335\', \'multiverseId\': 133573}, \'multiverseid\': 133573}, {\'name\': \'Inflamar Memórias\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo revela um card da própria mão aleatoriamente. Inflamar Memórias causa dano àquele jogador igual ao custo de mana convertido daquele card.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'182c7cc3-0a65-4f76-8e9a-b27f6b68565f\', \'multiverseId\': 133874}, \'multiverseid\': 133874}, {\'name\': \'Поджог Воспоминаний\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок показывает случайную карту из своей руки. Поджог Воспоминаний наносят этому игроку повреждения, равные конвертированной мана-стоимости этой карты.\\nШторм (Когда вы играете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое сыгранное в этом ходу заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для этих копий.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d6035e-6ce3-4739-bf94-0c45af81d308\', \'multiverseId\': 134175}, \'multiverseid\': 134175}, {\'name\': \'燃起回忆\', \'text\': \'目标牌手从其手上随机展示一张牌。 燃起回忆对该牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于该牌的总法术力费用。\\n风暴（当你使用此咒语时，本回合于它之前每使用过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。） 你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dbc2ab3-0034-474c-aad2-77fcf60ee71a\', \'multiverseId\': 132369}, \'multiverseid\': 132369}]', '[{\'name\': \'Burgraubvogel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange der Burgraubvogel enttappt ist, erhält er +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder Ort, an den wir gelangen, ist genauso in Trümmern und verlassen wie der zuvor. Also lasst uns hier bleiben, denn immerhin ist dies unsere Ruine."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1acef11-d3a9-42c8-aff6-ca2b4f03dd16\', \'multiverseId\': 132882}, \'multiverseid\': 132882}, {\'name\': \'Ráptores del castillo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras los Ráptores del castillo estén enderezados, obtienen +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada lugar que vemos está tan arruinado y muerto como el último. Así que aquí nos quedaremos, porque esta ruina es nuestra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2c4ec05-2882-4277-a1b1-69d7c7e72718\', \'multiverseId\': 134387}, \'multiverseid\': 134387}, {\'name\': \'Rapaces du château\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que les Rapaces du château sont dégagés, ils gagnent +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque endroit que nous visitons est aussi désolé et morne que le précédent. Alors nous restons ici, car au moins nous sommes chez nous. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43eca95-2fc7-4d8d-9511-6e5be3bfc403\', \'multiverseId\': 132581}, \'multiverseid\': 132581}, {\'name\': \'Raptor del Castello\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che i Raptor del Castello sono STAPpati, prendono +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello Soldato\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni posto che vediamo è in rovina e senza vita come quello precedente. Quindi rimaniamo qui, perché queste rovine sono nostre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51bbf62c-6f90-43f2-900b-6eab0c378f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 133183}, \'multiverseid\': 133183}, {\'name\': \'城の猛禽\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n城の猛禽がアンタップ状態であるかぎり、それは＋０/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'我々が見てきたところは、どこも同じように廃墟で人気が無いようだ。 それなら我々はここに留まることにしよう。今後はこの廃墟は我々の物だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79abb461-0e13-41ad-845f-f502d125c62f\', \'multiverseId\': 133484}, \'multiverseid\': 133484}, {\'name\': \'Raptores do Castelo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEnquanto Raptores do Castelo estiver desvirado, ele receberá +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada lugar que visitamos é tão arruinado e sem vida quanto o último. Por isso permanecemos aqui, porque esta é a nossa ruína."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8d1a48f-cef6-4883-8aee-f3ce3f6734c5\', \'multiverseId\': 133785}, \'multiverseid\': 133785}, {\'name\': \'Замковые Хищники\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПока Замковые Хищники не повернуты, они получают +0/+2.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждое место, что мы видели, разрушено и безжизненно окончательно. Потому мы останемся здесь, ведь эти руины наши».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb239e0-beb8-4587-9889-e099f5984009\', \'multiverseId\': 134086}, \'multiverseid\': 134086}, {\'name\': \'城堡猎鸟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要城堡猎鸟未横置，它便得+0/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我们见过的地方都同样地破败无生机。 所以我们留在这里，因为这遗迹属于我们。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd1d670-67f1-495b-be8d-5a0df2a38399\', \'multiverseId\': 132280}, \'multiverseid\': 132280}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böser Betrachter aus Urborg\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die keine Betrachter sind, können nicht angreifen.\\nImmer wenn der Böse Betrachter aus Urborg von einer Kreatur geblockt wird, zerstöre diese Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Betrachter\', \'flavor\': \'„Was zum Franz ist das für ein Ding dort, Edahlis? Wir hätten im Yavimaya bleiben sollen..."Aznaph, Pflanzensucher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efeb0037-df14-4791-8747-7f43dc98bd9e\', \'multiverseId\': 132924}, \'multiverseid\': 132924}, {\'name\': \'Ojo maléfico de Urborg\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas que no sean Ojos no pueden atacar.\\nSiempre que el Ojo maléfico de Urborg sea bloqueado por una criatura, destruye esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ojo\', \'flavor\': \'"Édahlis, ¿qué es eso? Deberíamos habernos quedado en Yavimaya. . . ."Áznaph, buscador de verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a55b1a-4751-4896-ad12-f01ddc91f30a\', \'multiverseId\': 134429}, \'multiverseid\': 134429}, {\'name\': "Œil maléfique d\'Urborg", \'text\': "Les créatures non-œil que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas attaquer.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Œil maléfique d\'Urborg devient bloqué par une créature, détruisez cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : œil\', \'flavor\': \'« Quelle est cette chose, Edahlis ? Nous aurions du rester dans la Yavimaya . . . »Aznaph, chercheur de verdure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132623&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e2d6bb3-2514-4555-86a9-f64085832bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 132623}, \'multiverseid\': 132623}, {\'name\': \'Occhio Malefico di Urborg\', \'text\': "Le creature non Occhio che controlli non possono attaccare.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Occhio Malefico di Urborg viene bloccato da una creatura, distruggi quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Occhio\', \'flavor\': \'"Edahlis, cos\\\'è quella cosa? Dovevamo rimanere a Yavimaya . . . ."Aznaph, cercatore verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e90ef963-d70d-4f8c-b6dd-bc6e1e080b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 133225}, \'multiverseid\': 133225}, {\'name\': \'アーボーグの邪眼\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする眼でないクリーチャーは攻撃できない。\\nアーボーグの邪眼がいずれかのクリーチャーにブロックされた状態になるたび、そのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 眼\', \'flavor\': \'そりゃいったい何だ、エダリス？ ヤヴィマヤに残るべきだったかなぁ … …。 ――緑探しのアズナフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bbaf057-cfc0-4d1a-a712-569a65f2bae4\', \'multiverseId\': 133526}, \'multiverseid\': 133526}, {\'name\': \'Olho Maligno de Urborg\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla que não sejam Olho não podem atacar.\\nToda vez que Olho Maligno de Urborg for bloqueado por uma criatura, destrua aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Olho\', \'flavor\': \'"Edahlis, o que é aquela coisa? Devíamos ter ficado em Yavimaya. . . ."Aznaph, busca-verde\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed2b163-077c-467c-940b-26ce69b5df6e\', \'multiverseId\': 133827}, \'multiverseid\': 133827}, {\'name\': \'Злой Глаз Урборга\', \'text\': \'Существа без типа Глаз под вашим контролем не могут атаковать.\\nКогда Злой Глаз Урборга блокируется существом, уничтожьте это существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Глаз\', \'flavor\': \'«Эдалис, что это такое? Мы должны были остаться в Явимае . . . » Азнаф, искатель цветущих земель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7481a4d-7400-45d2-bdb7-50f83623baa5\', \'multiverseId\': 134128}, \'multiverseid\': 134128}, {\'name\': \'乌尔博格邪眼\', \'text\': \'由你操控且不是眼的生物都不能进行攻击。\\n每当乌尔博格邪眼被生物阻挡时，消灭该生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～眼\', \'flavor\': \'「艾达黎，那到底是什么？ 我们应该留在亚维马雅才对. . . .」～寻碧者阿那夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e495b8-cee2-4b32-8e09-a285ca7b396a\', \'multiverseId\': 132322}, \'multiverseid\': 132322}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chamäleonsanpassung\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Schaden, den Kreaturen in diesem Zug Spielern zufügen würden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Manchmal ist es der beste Plan, weder zu kämpfen noch wegzurennen." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2c8b6b-89f4-475c-96cb-a0cc60c76de9\', \'multiverseId\': 132885}, \'multiverseid\': 132885}, {\'name\': \'Esfumado camaleónico\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño que las criaturas fueran a hacer a los jugadores este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"A veces el mejor plan no es luchar o huir, sino luchar y huir." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a70f90-5b98-4959-af88-de251a99307f\', \'multiverseId\': 134390}, \'multiverseid\': 134390}, {\'name\': \'Flou du caméléon\', \'text\': \'Prévenez toutes les blessures que les créatures devraient infliger aux joueurs ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Parfois, la meilleure stratégie n\'est ni de se battre, ni de courir. » —Freyalise", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ec72c3f-c024-443b-9f8e-794b21a6f71f\', \'multiverseId\': 132584}, \'multiverseid\': 132584}, {\'name\': \'Sfocatura del Camaleonte\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno che le creature infliggerebbero ai giocatori in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"A volte il piano migliore non è combattere né scappare." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3662da9e-cb23-48ba-b8f6-d2e64a5c23f8\', \'multiverseId\': 133186}, \'multiverseid\': 133186}, {\'name\': \'カメレオンのぼやかし\', \'text\': \'このターン、クリーチャーがプレイヤーに与えるダメージをすべて軽減し、０にする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'時には、戦うことも逃げることも最良の計画とならないこともあるのです。 ――フレイアリーズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb0a6d2-99cf-4551-9f63-cbb5ab77533e\', \'multiverseId\': 133487}, \'multiverseid\': 133487}, {\'name\': \'Borrão Camaleônico\', \'text\': \'Previna todo o dano que as criaturas causariam aos jogadores neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Algumas vezes o melhor plano é não lutar nem correr." —Freyalise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1394a17-3172-413b-a48c-478ac9a4a8e8\', \'multiverseId\': 133788}, \'multiverseid\': 133788}, {\'name\': \'Пятно Хамелеона\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все повреждения, которые существа будут наносить игрокам в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Иногда лучший план не сражаться и не бежать», Фреялиз\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f48a734-f6cf-4263-86a4-c7b4a009122f\', \'multiverseId\': 134089}, \'multiverseid\': 134089}, {\'name\': \'变色匿踪\', \'text\': \'于本回合中，防止生物将对牌手造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有时候战与走均非上策。」 ～妃雅丽兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecb83845-0d94-48d5-9aef-38af67815ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 132283}, \'multiverseid\': 132283}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatischer Stern\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere den Chromatischen Stern: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nWenn der Chromatische Stern aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser Gegenstand kommt nicht aus dem Jetzt. In ihm spiegelt sich ein Himmel, der nicht länger der unsrige ist, und er glüht voller Hoffnung, die wir nicht mehr haben." —Tavalus, Tempeldiener von Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d39d5319-6d86-4d3c-a332-0c9101dde1f3\', \'multiverseId\': 132887}, \'multiverseid\': 132887}, {\'name\': \'Estrella cromática\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Estrella cromática: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\\nCuando la Estrella cromática vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Este objeto no es de. . . ahora. Refleja un cielo que ya no es nuestro y brilla con una esperanza que ya no existe." —Távalus, acólito de Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd9a4918-bf53-46fb-ac75-2a07c60faa0a\', \'multiverseId\': 134392}, \'multiverseid\': 134392}, {\'name\': \'Étoile chromatique\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Étoile chromatique : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\\nQuand l\'Étoile chromatique est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Cet objet n\'est pas . . . d\'aujourd\'hui. Il reflète un ciel qui n\'est plus le nôtre et brille d\'un espoir qui n\'existe pas. » —Tavalus, acolyte de Korlis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe3acd5-7acd-4017-96ec-3356aefb9c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 132586}, \'multiverseid\': 132586}, {\'name\': \'Stella Cromatica\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Stella Cromatica: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\\nQuando la Stella Cromatica viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo oggetto non viene dal . . . presente. Riflette un cielo che non è più il nostro e brilla di una speranza che non esiste più." —Tavalus, accolito di Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f78c89a-a051-44bf-bc4d-446f8319743d\', \'multiverseId\': 133188}, \'multiverseid\': 133188}, {\'name\': \'彩色の星\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, 彩色の星を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n彩色の星が場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'この道具は … … ……現在の物ではありません。 これが映すのは、我らのものではない空と、ありもしない希望の輝きなのです。 ――コーリスの見習い僧、タヴァラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ed80b2-0d43-48c2-8dbe-c80e72042896\', \'multiverseId\': 133489}, \'multiverseid\': 133489}, {\'name\': \'Estrela Cromática\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Sacrifique Estrela Cromática: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\\nQuando Estrela Cromática for colocada num cemitério vinda do jogo, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Este objeto não é de. . . agora. Ele reflete um céu que não é mais o nosso e cintila com uma esperança que não mais existe." —Tavalus, acólito de Korlis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28be363-37ac-4b52-94e3-7e8d4f53d995\', \'multiverseId\': 133790}, \'multiverseid\': 133790}, {\'name\': \'Хроматическая звезда\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Пожертвуйте Хроматическую Звезду: Добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.\\nКогда Хроматическая Звезда попадает на кладбище из игры, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Эта вещица не из . . . настоящего. В ней отражаются не наши небеса, и сверкает она надеждой, которой больше нет», Тавалус, служитель Корлиса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b22f35-fbc0-4ce6-9ed3-ce22a83653ca\', \'multiverseId\': 134091}, \'multiverseid\': 134091}, {\'name\': \'五彩星\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，牺牲五彩星：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\\n当五彩星从场上置入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这东西不属于. . . 现在。 它所映射的天空不再属于我们，所闪现的希望已然不存。」 ～寇利斯侍僧塔瓦勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3466c2c-36f6-40cb-a205-151260dae07f\', \'multiverseId\': 132285}, \'multiverseid\': 132285}]', '[{\'name\': \'Davonwischen\', \'text\': \'Sekundenbruchteil (Solange dieser Zauberspruch sich auf dem Stapel befindet, können Spieler keine Zaubersprüche oder aktivierte Fähigkeiten spielen, die keine Manafähigkeiten sind.)\\nBringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Einen Augenblick später war die Baumbestie nicht mehr da, nur die Luft war noch unruhig, wo sie sich vorher bewegt hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133148&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e23fe96c-f4a6-410b-b9c1-576f57f31baa\', \'multiverseId\': 133148}, \'multiverseid\': 133148}, {\'name\': \'Limpiar\', \'text\': \'Fracción de segundo (Mientras este hechizo esté en la pila, los jugadores no pueden jugar hechizos o habilidades activadas que no sean habilidades de maná.)\\nRegresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un pestañeo más tarde, todo lo que quedaba de la bestia arbórea era la brisa de su impulso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e519d8d-a728-4a25-8a7d-e33231bc30cf\', \'multiverseId\': 134653}, \'multiverseid\': 134653}, {\'name\': \'Essuyage\', \'text\': \'Fraction de seconde (Tant que ce sort est sur la pile, les joueurs ne peuvent pas jouer de sorts ou de capacités activées qui ne sont pas des capacités de mana.)\\nRenvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Un instant plus tard, il ne restait de la bête sylvestre que le courant d\'air de son déplacement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2b225cc-51d4-4e4c-bad1-1d21b18fb88c\', \'multiverseId\': 132847}, \'multiverseid\': 132847}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Battibaleno (Fintanto che questa magia è in pila, i giocatori non possono giocare magie o abilità attivate che non siano abilità di mana.)\\nFai tornare un permanente bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un attimo dopo, tutto ciò che rimaneva della bestia-albero era la brezza del suo slancio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b98d4a9-cf43-4930-a9ec-9ab1b87d5fff\', \'multiverseId\': 133449}, \'multiverseid\': 133449}, {\'name\': \'拭い捨て\', \'text\': \'刹那 （この呪文がスタックにあるかぎり、プレイヤーは呪文やマナ能力でない起動型能力をプレイできない。）\\nパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'瞬き一つの後で残ったのは、樹の猛獣が巻き起こした風だけだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b501c778-9093-4153-9cce-316604964e42\', \'multiverseId\': 133750}, \'multiverseid\': 133750}, {\'name\': \'Limpar\', \'text\': \'Fração de segundo (Enquanto esta mágica estiver na pilha, os jogadores não poderão jogar mágicas ou habilidades ativadas que não sejam habilidades de mana.)\\nDevolva a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Um piscar de olhos depois e tudo o que sobrou da árvore-besta foi a brisa de sua força.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd863a5-296e-4986-828d-44bc2840c9b9\', \'multiverseId\': 134051}, \'multiverseid\': 134051}, {\'name\': \'Стирание\', \'text\': \'Мгновение ока (До тех пор пока это заклинание находится в стеке, игроки не могут играть заклинания или активируемые способности, которые не являются мана-способностями.)\\nВерните целевой перманент в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Через мгновение все, что осталось от древесного существа, стало лишь дыханием времени.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f4c6c03-6cdd-486c-a7d9-a6dd56b00648\', \'multiverseId\': 134352}, \'multiverseid\': 134352}, {\'name\': \'扫拂\', \'text\': \'转瞬（只要此咒语在堆叠上，牌手便不能使用咒语或不是法术力异能的起动式异能。）\\n将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'这树身怪兽一眨眼便没了踪影，只留下在那片刻的轻风。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e07eda-85b4-4d9a-a64c-58a854c6cc74\', \'multiverseId\': 132546}, \'multiverseid\': 132546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Tod des Narren\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe diese Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle zurück ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tod des Narren aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe den Tod des Narren auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a2a4508-71e3-4448-b153-3f9f14723476\', \'multiverseId\': 132936}, \'multiverseid\': 132936}, {\'name\': \'Fallecimiento del necio\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la criatura encantada vaya a un cementerio, regresa esa criatura al juego bajo tu control.\\nCuando el Fallecimiento del necio vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, regresa el Fallecimiento del necio a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd08609-f4dd-4618-b72e-67c52a56811c\', \'multiverseId\': 134441}, \'multiverseid\': 134441}, {\'name\': "Décès de l\'imbécile", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la créature enchantée est mise dans un cimetière, renvoyez en jeu cette créature sous votre contrôle.\\nQuand le Décès de l\'imbécile est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, renvoyez le Décès de l\'imbécile dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132635&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b25fc62-4ee9-4841-a69c-8bc4fc42d693\', \'multiverseId\': 132635}, \'multiverseid\': 132635}, {\'name\': \'Dipartita dello Sciocco\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la creatura incantata viene messa in un cimitero, rimetti in gioco quella creatura sotto il tuo controllo.\\nQuando la Dipartita dello Sciocco viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, fai tornare la Dipartita dello Sciocco in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35bfcd0-2fc7-4d4e-99c6-32b2d0b2cbb5\', \'multiverseId\': 133237}, \'multiverseid\': 133237}, {\'name\': \'愚か者の死\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、そのクリーチャーをあなたのコントロール下で場に戻す。\\n愚か者の死が場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、愚か者の死をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a511ea62-4498-4176-b5a4-14d866e38940\', \'multiverseId\': 133538}, \'multiverseid\': 133538}, {\'name\': \'Falecimento do Tolo\', \'text\': \'Encantar Criatura\\nQuando a criatura encantada for colocada em um cemitério, devolva-a para o jogo sob seu controle.\\nQuando Falecimento do Tolo for colocado no cemitério vindo do jogo, devolva-o para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf9474e2-38d8-4599-b5ea-8616f864de2d\', \'multiverseId\': 133839}, \'multiverseid\': 133839}, {\'name\': \'Кончина Дурака\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда зачарованное существо попадает на кладбище, верните это существо в игру под вашим контролем.\\nКогда Кончина Дурака попадает на кладбище из игры, верните Кончину Дурака в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2fe8195-bcda-4318-9392-014d868f5728\', \'multiverseId\': 134140}, \'multiverseid\': 134140}, {\'name\': \'假死\', \'text\': \'生物结界\\n当受此结界的生物置入坟墓场时，将该生物在你的操控下返回场上。\\n当假死从场上置入坟墓场时，将假死移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a050af-0435-4b24-a028-9924b87b116e\', \'multiverseId\': 132334}, \'multiverseid\': 132334}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dickhäutiger Goblin\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {0} bezahlen, anstatt die Echokosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, zu bezahlen.\\n{R}: Der Dickhäutige Goblin erhält Schutz vor Rot bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Der Stammesschamane ist verantwortlich dafür, den Überblick über alle Schätze des Stammes zu behalten, einschließlich wütenden Haustieren und verfluchten Lampen der feurigen Verdammnis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133116&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a4208c-ba02-48fb-a795-277e5e206b02\', \'multiverseId\': 133116}, \'multiverseid\': 133116}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo de piel gruesa\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {0} en lugar de pagar el coste de eco de los permanentes que controlas.\\n{R}: El Trasgo de piel gruesa gana protección contra rojo hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'El chamán de la tribu es responsable de llevar registro de todos sus tesoros, incluyendo las mascotas furiosas y las lámparas malditas de la perdición ardiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30196b99-f418-45ea-bddc-d05753710c94\', \'multiverseId\': 134621}, \'multiverseid\': 134621}, {\'name\': \'Gobelin à la peau dure\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez payer {0} à la place du coût d\'écho des permanents que vous contrôlez.\\n{R} : Le Gobelin à la peau dure acquiert la protection contre le rouge jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Le shamane de la tribu est responsable de tous ses trésors, depuis les animaux de compagnie hargneux jusqu\'aux lampes maudites de mort par incandescence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69fa7a69-bf67-46a4-9717-eeb1d965f86b\', \'multiverseId\': 132815}, \'multiverseid\': 132815}, {\'name\': \'Goblin dalla Pelle Dura\', \'text\': \'Puoi pagare {0} invece di pagare il costo di eco per i permanenti che controlli.\\n{R}: Il Goblin dalla Pelle Dura ha protezione dal rosso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Lo sciamano della tribù ha la responsabilità di tenersi al corrente su tutti i suoi tesori, comprese bestiole rabbiose e lanterne maledette di devastazione infuocata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f9a8c3d-4ab5-4f92-bb2e-ff1e6155e37c\', \'multiverseId\': 133417}, \'multiverseid\': 133417}, {\'name\': \'厚皮のゴブリン\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたがコントロールするパーマネントのエコー･コストを支払うのではなく、{0}を支払ってもよい。\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、厚皮のゴブリンはプロテクション（赤）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'シャーマンは部族の宝物の管理をする責任を負っている。その中には、怒れるペットやら、呪われた火難のランプなどが含まれている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90147b87-fee0-4229-9511-5e9c003c3760\', \'multiverseId\': 133718}, \'multiverseid\': 133718}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Paquidérmico\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {0}, em vez de pagar seu custo de eco para as permanentes que você controla.\\n{R}: Goblin Paquidérmico ganha proteção contra o vermelho até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Xamã Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'O xamã da tribo é responsável por todos os seus tesouros, incluindo animais de estimação furiosos e lanternas amaldiçoadas de destruição ardente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55fe2dc2-3276-4f4d-ac1a-d7918d63550b\', \'multiverseId\': 134019}, \'multiverseid\': 134019}, {\'name\': \'Тонкошкурый Гоблин\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заплатить {0} вместо того чтобы платить эхо-стоимость перманентов под вашим контролем.\\n{R}: Тонкошкурый гоблин получает защиту от красного до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Шаманы этого клана несли отвественность за подсчет всех их сокровищ, включая злобных животных и проклятые лампы пламенного рока.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7bbf74-4899-4ebd-9bdc-7dd8bb1f8424\', \'multiverseId\': 134320}, \'multiverseid\': 134320}, {\'name\': \'皮厚精灵\', \'text\': \'你可支付{0}，而不支付由你操控的永久物之返响费用。\\n{R}：皮厚精灵获得反红保护异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'此族祭师负责管好所有的宝物，包括脾气暴躁的宠物，以及满腹怒火的受诅油灯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38fe5088-fafa-47b6-9187-06de1794ed93\', \'multiverseId\': 132514}, \'multiverseid\': 132514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Baracken leeren\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 1/1 rote Goblinspielsteine ins Spiel.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie strömten aus den Baracken, um in den Krieg zu ziehen — und damit sich die Matronen weiter ausdehnen konnten." —Sarpadische Reiche, Band IV\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362b35f1-945b-4187-8eee-826ad5a7cb11\', \'multiverseId\': 132918}, \'multiverseid\': 132918}, {\'name\': \'Vaciar los barracones\', \'text\': \'Pon en juego dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Abandonan los barracones para la guerra, y para hacer lugar para las matronas con camada." —Imperios sarpadianos, vol. IV\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5eff80c-f0ad-485a-9034-20cc384bd780\', \'multiverseId\': 134423}, \'multiverseid\': 134423}, {\'name\': \'Évacuation des terriers\', \'text\': \'Mettez en jeu deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils sortaient de leurs terriers pour faire la guerre (et pour échapper à leurs matrones enceintes). » —Les Empires sarpadiens, Vol. IV\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d0875b0-71a2-4e34-8b50-b57300e2a41d\', \'multiverseId\': 132617}, \'multiverseid\': 132617}, {\'name\': \'Svuotare i Cunicoli\', \'text\': \'Metti in gioco due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\nTempesta (Quando giochi questa magia, copiala per ogni magia giocata prima in questo turno).\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Si riversarono fuori dai cunicoli per andare in guerra (e per fare spazio alle matrone che partorivano)." —Imperi di Sarpadia, Vol. IV\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ed27b7-e20b-4f0b-8c56-693f757da9c6\', \'multiverseId\': 133219}, \'multiverseid\': 133219}, {\'name\': \'巣穴からの総出\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体場に出す。\\nストーム （あなたがこの呪文をプレイしたとき、それを、このターンそれより前にプレイされていた呪文の総数に等しい回数だけコピーする。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは戦争のために（そして子を産む婦人達の場所を空けるために）巣穴を飛び出した。 ――サーペイディア諸帝国史、 第四巻\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eebf69ff-8fb1-439b-8dad-08b384267b78\', \'multiverseId\': 133520}, \'multiverseid\': 133520}, {\'name\': \'Esvaziar os Viveiros\', \'text\': \'Coloque em jogo duas fichas de criatura vermelhas 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles foram liberados dos viveiros para guerrear (e para ceder espaço às matronas parideiras)." —Impérios Sarpadianos, vol. IV\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ae8be4-efa1-4887-912f-672a2e8736e3\', \'multiverseId\': 133821}, \'multiverseid\': 133821}, {\'name\': \'Исход из Угодий\', \'text\': \'Положите две фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин в игру.\\nШторм (Когда вы играете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое сыгранное в этом ходу заклинание.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Они выкатывались из своих угодий ради войны (и для высвобождения места для рожающих матрон)», Сарпадианские Империи, Том IV\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3b45b44-706c-47c5-86ab-24020ad9e3d7\', \'multiverseId\': 134122}, \'multiverseid\': 134122}, {\'name\': \'净空繁殖地\', \'text\': \'将两个1/1红色精灵衍生物放置进场。\\n风暴（当你使用此咒语时，本回合于它之前每使用过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们会从繁殖地倾巢而出来兴战（顺便给多产的女舍监空出位子）。」 ～撒尔帕汀帝国，卷 四\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50e26e7-f3d5-43df-90e9-b871e66210b2\', \'multiverseId\': 132316}, \'multiverseid\': 132316}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donner-Totem\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}.\\n{1}{W}{W}: Das Donner-Totem wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/2 weißen Geist-Artefaktkreatur mit Erstschlag und Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7e7299-9148-46ee-86e1-5d1faca679c8\', \'multiverseId\': 133119}, \'multiverseid\': 133119}, {\'name\': \'Tótem del trueno\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {W} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{1}{W}{W}: El Tótem del trueno es una criatura artefacto Espíritu blanca 2/2 con las habilidades de volar y dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b9d54e-4e08-4215-9acf-2f706e22f956\', \'multiverseId\': 134624}, \'multiverseid\': 134624}, {\'name\': \'Totem de tonnerre\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {W} à votre réserve.\\n{1}{W}{W} : Le Totem de tonnerre devient une créature-artefact 2/2 blanche Esprit avec le vol et l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01daa05e-c765-4e2a-a84b-118e24685830\', \'multiverseId\': 132818}, \'multiverseid\': 132818}, {\'name\': \'Totem del Tuono\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{1}{W}{W}: Il Totem del Tuono diventa una creatura artefatto Spirito 2/2 bianca con volare e attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbffc457-eaf7-403e-bc51-a21cc10c932b\', \'multiverseId\': 133420}, \'multiverseid\': 133420}, {\'name\': \'雷のトーテム像\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}を加える。\\n{1}{W}{W}：ターン終了時まで、雷のトーテム像は飛行と先制攻撃を持つ白の２/２のスピリット・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0d90f0-ca07-46a0-bb2f-115e2cd06e8e\', \'multiverseId\': 133721}, \'multiverseid\': 133721}, {\'name\': \'Totem do Trovão\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {W} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{1}{W}{W}: Totem do Trovão torna-se uma criatura artefato branca 2/2 do tipo Espírito com a habilidade de voar e iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a036fd14-d28f-47bf-8204-89214d270289\', \'multiverseId\': 134022}, \'multiverseid\': 134022}, {\'name\': \'Громовой Тотем\', \'text\': \'{T}: Добавьте {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{1}{W}{W}: Громовой Тотем становится артефактным существом 2/2 белый Дух с полетом и первым ударом до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff209de-4068-4af4-8d02-84eed1c59b55\', \'multiverseId\': 134323}, \'multiverseid\': 134323}, {\'name\': \'雷霆图腾像\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}到你的法术力池中。\\n{1}{W}{W}：雷霆图腾像成为2/2白色，具飞行与先攻异能的精怪神器生物直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175daf61-4730-4cd3-b0dd-ae7c64fe8fc5\', \'multiverseId\': 132517}, \'multiverseid\': 132517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dralnu, Lichfürst\', \'text\': \'Falls Dralnu Schaden zugefügt würde, opfere stattdessen ebenso viele bleibende Karten.\\n{T}: Eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Rückblende. Ihre Rückblendekosten werden gleich ihrer Manakosten, sowie du sie spielst. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten spielen. Entferne sie dann ganz aus dem Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Herrscher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74e47c1-ff53-448e-a6b8-4e6cdd33c77f\', \'multiverseId\': 132909}, \'multiverseid\': 132909}, {\'name\': \'Dralnu, señor liche\', \'text\': \'Si se le fuera a hacer daño a Dralnu, en vez de eso, sacrifica esa misma cantidad de permanentes.\\n{T}: La carta de instantáneo o conjuro en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de retrospectiva hasta el final del turno. Su coste de retrospectiva es igual a su coste de maná mientras lo juegas. (Puedes jugar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego remuévela del juego. El coste de maná incluye el color.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Señor Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dad52cf-dd4c-45d6-9d69-44774588c34f\', \'multiverseId\': 134414}, \'multiverseid\': 134414}, {\'name\': \'Dralnu, seigneur liche\', \'text\': "Si des blessures devaient être infligées à Dralnu, sacrifiez autant de permanents à la place.\\n{T} : La carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée de votre cimetière a le flashback jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Son coût de flashback devient égal à son coût de mana au moment où vous la jouez. (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Retirez-la ensuite de la partie.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et seigneur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbaebe77-87bd-46ae-b808-8e18728aa795\', \'multiverseId\': 132608}, \'multiverseid\': 132608}, {\'name\': \'Dralnu, Signore dei Lich\', \'text\': \'Se sta per essere inflitto danno a Dralnu, sacrifica invece altrettanti permanenti.\\n{T}: Una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio nel tuo cimitero ha flashback fino alla fine del turno. Il suo costo di flashback diventa pari al suo costo di mana quando la giochi. (Puoi giocare quella carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi rimuovila dal gioco).\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Signore Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08227410-d5d4-442f-b173-1d29284c9c60\', \'multiverseId\': 133210}, \'multiverseid\': 133210}, {\'name\': \'死者の王、ドラルヌ\', \'text\': \'死者の王、ドラルヌにダメージが与えられる場合、代わりにその点数に等しい数のパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。\\n{T}：あなたの墓地にあるインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー･カード１枚を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはフラッシュバックを持つ。 それのフラッシュバック･コストは、それをプレイする際のマナ・コストに等しい。 （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。 その後それをゲームから取り除く）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・ロード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1388ad2-638f-4bff-a632-318b58b82d12\', \'multiverseId\': 133511}, \'multiverseid\': 133511}, {\'name\': \'Dralnu, Senhor dos Cadáveres\', \'text\': \'Se dano fosse ser causado a Dralnu, em vez disso, sacrifique a mesma quantidade de permanentes.\\n{T}: O card de mágica instantânea alvo ou de feitiço alvo em seu cemitério tem recapitular até o final do turno. Seu custo de recapitulação torna-se igual ao seu custo de mana ao jogá-lo. (Você pode jogar aquele card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitulação. Depois remova-o do jogo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Senhor Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c7d3e7-1dbd-42ba-8a33-81c059cd2ed7\', \'multiverseId\': 133812}, \'multiverseid\': 133812}, {\'name\': \'Дралну, Лорд Лич\', \'text\': \'Если повреждения должны наноситься Дралну, вместо этого пожертвуйте такое же количество перманентов.\\n{T}: Целевая карта мгновенного заклинания или волшебства в вашем кладбище имеет Воспоминание до конца хода. Ее стоимость Воспоминания равняется ее мана-стоимости для игры. (Вы можете играть выбранную карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость воспоминания. Затем удалите ее из игры.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Зомби Предводитель\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07d3557-3966-4249-b1e8-8445369ebca5\', \'multiverseId\': 134113}, \'multiverseid\': 134113}, {\'name\': \'巫妖领主卓尔努\', \'text\': \'若卓尔努将受到伤害，则改为牺牲等量的永久物。\\n{T}：目标在你坟墓场中的瞬间或法术牌获得返照异能直到回合结束。 你使用该牌时，其返照费用等同于其法术力费用。 （你可以从你的坟墓场使用该牌，并支付其返照费用， 然后将它移出对战。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～灵俑／领主\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a9de6f-2f87-47a6-a518-961cfcad4875\', \'multiverseId\': 132307}, \'multiverseid\': 132307}]', "[{'name': 'Dunkles Verdorren', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nWahnsinn {B} (Falls du diese Karte aus deiner Hand abwirfst, kannst du sie für ihre Wahnsinn-Kosten spielen, anstatt sie auf deinen Friedhof zu legen.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132901&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '967fabcd-d8b7-4e25-8c85-0ebf757c9830', 'multiverseId': 132901}, 'multiverseid': 132901}, {'name': 'Agotamiento siniestro', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra.\\nDemencia {B} (Si descartas esta carta, puedes jugarla por su coste de demencia en vez de ponerla en tu cementerio.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134406&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bd8e2ab-16da-4dba-9de3-81c68f93130f', 'multiverseId': 134406}, 'multiverseid': 134406}, {'name': 'Obscur flétrissement', 'text': 'Détruisez la créature non-noire ciblée.\\nFolie {B} (Si vous vous défaussez de cette carte, vous pouvez la jouer pour son coût de folie à la place de la mettre dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132600&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96186f4c-24fe-4a65-9e29-25c63d677b16', 'multiverseId': 132600}, 'multiverseid': 132600}, {'name': 'Avvizzimento Oscuro', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio non nera.\\nFollia {B} (Se scarti questa carta, puoi giocarla pagando il suo costo di follia invece di metterla nel tuo cimitero.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133202&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f01632b5-0648-4699-aa6c-755482b1dc62', 'multiverseId': 133202}, 'multiverseid': 133202}, {'name': '闇の萎縮', 'text': '黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\nマッドネス {B} （あなたがこのカードを捨てる場合、あなたはそれをあなたの墓地に置く代わりに、マッドネス・コストでそれをプレイしてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133503&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4529db5-9aed-4f7d-aca7-1de75c2f1a42', 'multiverseId': 133503}, 'multiverseid': 133503}, {'name': 'Definhamento Sombrio', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo que não seja preta.\\nLoucura {B} (Se descartar este card, você poderá jogá-lo pelo seu custo de loucura, em vez de colocá-lo em seu cemitério.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133804&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a622c875-dff5-41ab-9c4b-782c368af2e2', 'multiverseId': 133804}, 'multiverseid': 133804}, {'name': 'Темное Испепеление', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое нечерное существо.\\nБешенство {B} (Если вы сбрасываете эту карту, вы можете сыграть ее за ее стоимость бешенства вместо того чтобы положить ее на ваше кладбище.)', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134105&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6086634e-6a92-466c-9240-4a831b8a16ec', 'multiverseId': 134105}, 'multiverseid': 134105}, {'name': '黯境枯萎', 'text': '消灭目标非黑色的生物。\\n疯魔{B}（如果你弃掉此牌，可以改为使用它并支付其疯魔费用，而非直接将它置入你的坟墓场。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132299&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93dfcd73-07e0-4ae9-b047-3754b227788d', 'multiverseId': 132299}, 'multiverseid': 132299}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durch die Gegend trampeln\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursachen alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden und erhalten +1/+1 für jeden Standardlandtyp unter den Ländern, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In den tiefen Hufabdrücken der Herde konnte man Salzklümpchen aus Benalia, Moos aus Llanowar, Staub aus Hurloon und sogar Eschenholz aus Urborg finden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133126&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4cffed-3558-409e-82f3-0b6918f44b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 133126}, \'multiverseid\': 133126}, {\'name\': \'Pisotear los dominios\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar y obtienen +1/+1 por cada tipo de tierra básico entre las tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Bajo las pisadas de la manada salvaje quedaron bloques de sal de Benalia, musgo de Llanowar, polvo de Hurloon y cenizas del lejano Urborg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1775ad77-2eef-4dbe-b711-c384e6c219d2\', \'multiverseId\': 134631}, \'multiverseid\': 134631}, {\'name\': \'Fouler les domaines\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement et gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque type de terrain de base parmi les terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans les empreintes du troupeau enragé, il y avait des cristaux de sel de Bénalia, de la mousse de Llanowar, de la poussière de l\'Hurloon et des cendres de la contrée lointaine d\'Urborg.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d13ca78-e0c0-44dc-bd95-a21949bb186f\', \'multiverseId\': 132825}, \'multiverseid\': 132825}, {\'name\': \'Calpestare i Domini\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, le creature che controlli hanno travolgere e prendono +1/+1 per ogni tipo di terra base tra le terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Compressi nelle orme della mandria inferocita si trovavano agglomerati di sale da Benalia, muschio da Llanowar, polvere da Hurloon e cenere perfino da Urborg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061e1972-d802-4b60-84fe-1ef55a8392ef\', \'multiverseId\': 133427}, \'multiverseid\': 133427}, {\'name\': \'版図の踏みつけ\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーはトランプルを得るとともにあなたがコントロールする各基本土地タイプ１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ベナリアの岩塩、ラノワールの苔、ハールーンの埃、そしてアーボーグの灰すらもが荒々しい群れの足跡に削られた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f0d15c-00cd-49a0-b49f-554d0fd61081\', \'multiverseId\': 133728}, \'multiverseid\': 133728}, {\'name\': \'Galopar pelos Domínios\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, as criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar e recebem +1/+1 para cada tipo de terreno básico entre os terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A terra nas pegadas da manada furiosa era composta por pedaços de sal de Benália, limo de Llanowar, poeira de Hurloon, e cinzas da longínqua Urborg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f94096-3aed-4391-a1df-51e2f21b0c45\', \'multiverseId\': 134029}, \'multiverseid\': 134029}, {\'name\': \'Вытоптать Земли\', \'text\': \'До конца хода существа под вашим контролем получают пробивной удар и +1/+1 за каждый тип базовых земель под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Земля покрыта следами обезумевших табунов, средь них были комья соли из Беналии, мох из Лановара, пыль из Хурлуна и даже прах из Урборга.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'618cd06c-3efa-4a48-b2c9-8113c607b8d8\', \'multiverseId\': 134330}, \'multiverseid\': 134330}, {\'name\': \'重跺领土\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，由你操控的生物获得践踏异能，且由你操控的地之中每有一种基本地类别，这些生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'深深嵌入肆虐兽群足迹者，包括宾纳里亚的盐粒，罗堰的绿苔，夏浓的尘土，甚至打从乌尔博格来的泥灰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee4f09c-1030-438d-8f6d-f1297297c2a6\', \'multiverseId\': 132524}, \'multiverseid\': 132524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durcheinanderbringen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Teferi schnippte mit den Fingern, und plötzlich gackerte der Viashino wie ein Huhn. Sicher — es war nur albern, aber genau so etwas hatten wir benötigt, um die aufgebaute Spannung zu lösen." —Jhoira, Meisterbastler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89921f8d-39a0-4243-a124-3056c7755927\', \'multiverseId\': 132870}, \'multiverseid\': 132870}, {\'name\': \'Azorar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Teferi chasqueó sus dedos, y el viashino empezó a cacarear como una gallina. Tonto, es cierto, pero era exactamente lo que necesitábamos para romper el hielo." —Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2ffc9f-328e-4173-97de-6256772ec87e\', \'multiverseId\': 134375}, \'multiverseid\': 134375}, {\'name\': \'Ahurissement\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -3/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Téfeiri claqua des doigts et le viashino se mit à caqueter comme une poule. Immature, certes, mais c\'était exactement ce qu\'il nous fallait pour briser la tension. » —Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f141f292-cdf3-4a10-8910-c9129279c170\', \'multiverseId\': 132569}, \'multiverseid\': 132569}, {\'name\': \'Disorientare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Teferi schioccò le dita e il viashino iniziò a chiocciare come una gallina. Sciocco, sì, ma proprio quel che ci voleva per spezzare la tensione opprimente." —Jhoira, mastro artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd90978-cd82-4118-b386-257b00e9f1c6\', \'multiverseId\': 133171}, \'multiverseid\': 133171}, {\'name\': \'戸惑い\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－３/－０の修整を受ける。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'テフェリーが指を鳴らせば、ヴィーアシーノが鶏みたいに鳴きだしたものよ。 そうね、馬鹿馬鹿しいけど、重苦しい雰囲気を吹き飛ばすのにそれが間違いなく必要だったのよ。 ――工芸の達人、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'035d50d1-5994-4890-bb72-4522698951bb\', \'multiverseId\': 133472}, \'multiverseid\': 133472}, {\'name\': \'Desnortear\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -3/-0 até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Teferi estalou os dedos e o viashino começou a cacarejar como uma galinha. Uma bobeira, sim, mas era exatamente o que precisávamos para quebrar a tensão asfixiante." — Jhoira, mestre artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb05c07f-6583-48ce-b1a6-d1ff73c1872b\', \'multiverseId\': 133773}, \'multiverseid\': 133773}, {\'name\': \'Замешательство\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -3/-0 до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Тефери щелкнул пальцами, и виашино закудахтал как цыпленок. Глупо? Да, но это именно то, что помогало снять гнетущее напряжение», Джойра, мастер-изобретатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4bde071-5210-4fd3-a6bf-fbd4d2a23c7a\', \'multiverseId\': 134074}, \'multiverseid\': 134074}, {\'name\': \'茫然不已\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-3/-0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「泰菲力一弹指，那凡尔西诺便像只鸡似地开始喀喀叫。 这确实是挺蠢的，但也成功地化解了令人窒息的紧张气氛。」 ～神器大师尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2af985e-385f-4ae4-87c0-41ca147a030e\', \'multiverseId\': 132268}, \'multiverseid\': 132268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerlichtwanderfalke\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Schutz vor Schwarz\\nAussetzen 3 {1}{W} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu spielen, kannst du {1}{W} bezahlen, sie ganz aus dem Spiel entfernen und drei Zeitmarken auf sie legen. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn du die letzte Zeitmarke entfernst, spiele die Karte, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Sie hat Eile.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73abc57-ec99-45d1-b292-437da89b713c\', \'multiverseId\': 132917}, \'multiverseid\': 132917}, {\'name\': \'Peregrino del crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Vuela, protección contra negro.\\nSuspender 3—{1}{W} (En lugar de jugar esta carta de tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{W} y removerla del juego con tres contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, juégala sin pagar su coste de maná. Tiene la habilidad de prisa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f24594e4-13b0-47d4-8102-33613395cb6f\', \'multiverseId\': 134422}, \'multiverseid\': 134422}, {\'name\': \'Faucon pèlerin crépusculaire\', \'text\': \'Vol, protection contre le noir\\nSuspension 3 — {1}{W} (Plutôt que jouer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{W} et la retirer de la partie avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand vous retirez le dernier, jouez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Elle a la célérité.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132616&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143766cb-1047-49be-817f-21f97abfd4f4\', \'multiverseId\': 132616}, \'multiverseid\': 132616}, {\'name\': "Falco Pellegrino dell\'Imbrunire", \'text\': "Volare, protezione dal nero\\nSospendere 3—{1}{W} (Invece di giocare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {1}{W} e rimuoverla dal gioco con tre segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando rimuovi l\'ultimo, gioca la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Ha rapidità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e426fc56-2a7b-43cf-9987-c0f7d3b3715a\', \'multiverseId\': 133218}, \'multiverseid\': 133218}, {\'name\': \'ダスクライダーの大隼\', \'text\': \'飛行、プロテクション（黒）\\n待機 ３―{1}{W} （これをあなたの手札からプレイするのではなく、{1}{W}を支払ってゲームから取り除き、その上に時間カウンターを３個置いてもよい。 あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。 最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払わずにプレイする。 それは速攻を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28e9e1f4-a83f-445d-9c5a-be930f850c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 133519}, \'multiverseid\': 133519}, {\'name\': \'Falcão-Peregrino do Crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Voar, proteção contra o preto\\nSuspender 3—{1}{W} (Em vez de jogar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {1}{W} e removê-lo do jogo com três marcadores temporais sobre ele. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando remover o último, jogue-o sem pagar seu custo de mana. Ele tem ímpeto.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42dda851-82c5-4e32-b742-c000c9de1f63\', \'multiverseId\': 133820}, \'multiverseid\': 133820}, {\'name\': \'Сапсан Сумречных Наездников\', \'text\': \'Полет, защита от черного\\nОтсрочка 3—{1}{W} (Вместо того чтобы сыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {1}{W} и удалить ее из игры с тремя временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда вы удалите последний, сыграйте эту карту без оплаты ее мана-стоимости. Она получает ускорение.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8201dbd-7699-4ab2-96c6-dfd3a9bfbd1c\', \'multiverseId\': 134121}, \'multiverseid\': 134121}, {\'name\': \'暮骑兵游隼\', \'text\': \'飞行，反黑保护\\n延缓3～{1}{W}（除了从你手上使用此牌，你可以支付{1}{W}并将此牌移出对战，且上面有三个计时指示物。 在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。 当你移去最后一个时，则使用它且不需支付其法术力费用。 它具有敏捷。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8890b6d-3fe3-4def-b3d5-5b23c77da3ad\', \'multiverseId\': 132315}, \'multiverseid\': 132315}]', "[{'name': 'Dämonische Absprache', 'text': 'Rückkauf wirf zwei Karten aus deiner Hand ab. (Du kannst zusätzlich zu allen anderen Kosten zwei Karten abwerfen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch spielst. Falls du dies tust, nimm diese Karte auf deine Hand, sowie sie verrechnet wird.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte und nimm diese Karte auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132905&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e17f5037-f67d-482f-a03f-45342450ad58', 'multiverseId': 132905}, 'multiverseid': 132905}, {'name': 'Confabulación demoníaca', 'text': 'Recuperar—Descartar dos cartas. (Puedes descartar dos cartas además de cualquier otro coste en cuanto juegues este hechizo. Si lo haces, pon esta carta en tu mano en cuanto se resuelve.)\\nBusca una carta de tu biblioteca y pon esa carta en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134410&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eef25685-f261-4ca0-9f92-da15e145aaf0', 'multiverseId': 134410}, 'multiverseid': 134410}, {'name': 'Collusion démoniaque', 'text': 'Rappel — Défaussez-vous de deux cartes. (Vous pouvez vous défausser de deux cartes en supplément de tous autres coûts quand vous jouez ce sort. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez cette carte dans votre main au moment où elle se résout.)\\nCherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque et mettez cette carte dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132604&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '932dca1f-da03-4efb-8cb5-3ccbd979497d', 'multiverseId': 132604}, 'multiverseid': 132604}, {'name': 'Collusione Demoniaca', 'text': 'Riscatto—Scarta due carte. (Puoi scartare due carte oltre a qualsiasi altro costo quando giochi questa magia. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano questa carta quando si risolve.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta e aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133206&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8328e0a-de01-4b1d-8966-6de83403e6e0', 'multiverseId': 133206}, 'multiverseid': 133206}, {'name': '悪魔の談合', 'text': 'バイバック ― カードを２枚捨てる。 （この呪文をプレイする際に、あなたは他のコストに加えてカードを２枚捨ててもよい。 そうした場合、それの解決に際し、このカードをあなたの手札に加える。）\\nあなたのライブラリーからカードを１枚探し、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133507&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd4c6967-6b17-4769-882a-ad2b94e0d37a', 'multiverseId': 133507}, 'multiverseid': 133507}, {'name': 'Colusão Demoníaca', 'text': 'Recuperar—Descarte dois cards. (Você pode descartar dois cards além de quaisquer outros custos ao jogar esta mágica. Se fizer isso, coloque este card em sua mão quando for resolvido.)\\nProcure em seu grimório por um card e coloque aquele card em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133808&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb070418-0498-4875-a65c-2768cd8b003b', 'multiverseId': 133808}, 'multiverseid': 133808}, {'name': 'Демонический Заговор', 'text': 'Выкуп Сбросьте две карты. (Вы можете сбросить две карты при игре этого заклинания. Если вы это сделаете, положите эту карту в вашу руку в результате ее разрешения.)\\nПоищите в вашей библиотеке карту и положите ее в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134109&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed07d056-d9e3-441c-80ad-af673951bdd1', 'multiverseId': 134109}, 'multiverseid': 134109}, {'name': '与魔共谋', 'text': '购回～弃两张牌。 （你使用此咒语时可以额外弃两张牌并支付任何其它费用。 若你如此做，则结算此咒语时将它放入你的手牌。）\\n从你的牌库中搜寻一张牌并置于你手上。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132303&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fd8e34e-4265-4962-b59f-e163f39048a4', 'multiverseId': 132303}, 'multiverseid': 132303}]", '[{\'name\': \'Düsterwaldbaloth\', \'text\': \'Aussetzen 5 {G} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu spielen, kannst du {G} bezahlen, sie ganz aus dem Spiel entfernen und fünf Zeitmarken auf sie legen. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn du die letzte Zeitmarke entfernst, spiele die Karte, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Sie hat Eile.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132915&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88dcb88d-0359-4ab9-a00e-8f080346aae5\', \'multiverseId\': 132915}, \'multiverseid\': 132915}, {\'name\': \'Báloth del bosque de Durk\', \'text\': \'Suspender 5—{G} (En lugar de jugar esta carta de tu mano, puedes pagar {G} y removerla del juego con cinco contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, juégala sin pagar su coste de maná. Tiene la habilidad de prisa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0418b2ff-2715-44fc-8d48-0814b1c35ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 134420}, \'multiverseid\': 134420}, {\'name\': \'Baloth de Boissambre\', \'text\': \'Suspension 5 — {G} (Plutôt que jouer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {G} et la retirer de la partie avec cinq marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand vous retirez le dernier, jouez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Elle a la célérité.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132614&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa97c10b-889d-4ffc-8718-ba7dbe198a67\', \'multiverseId\': 132614}, \'multiverseid\': 132614}, {\'name\': \'Baloth di Durkwood\', \'text\': "Sospendere 5—{G} (Invece di giocare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {G} e rimuoverla dal gioco con cinque segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando rimuovi l\'ultimo, gioca la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Ha rapidità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc39680-cc59-4bc3-8a32-de0db12dccaa\', \'multiverseId\': 133216}, \'multiverseid\': 133216}, {\'name\': \'ダークウッドのベイロス\', \'text\': \'待機 ５―{G} （これをあなたの手札からプレイするのではなく、{G}を支払ってゲームから取り除き、その上に時間カウンターを５個置いてもよい。 あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。 最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払わずにプレイする。 それは速攻を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10ed4b7d-4a4f-4e02-b917-9da9ed4fa027\', \'multiverseId\': 133517}, \'multiverseid\': 133517}, {\'name\': \'Baloth de Durkwood\', \'text\': \'Suspender 5—{G} (Em vez de jogar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {G} e removê-lo do jogo com cinco marcadores temporais sobre ele. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando remover o último, jogue-o sem pagar seu custo de mana. Ele tem ímpeto.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adf7ef2a-b471-44f7-a157-9707e8b7c80c\', \'multiverseId\': 133818}, \'multiverseid\': 133818}, {\'name\': \'Дарквудский Балот\', \'text\': \'Отсрочка 5—{G} (Вместо того чтобы сыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {G} и удалить ее из игры с пятью временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда вы удалите последний, сыграйте эту карту без оплаты ее мана-стоимости. Она имеет укорение.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e339bd4-c7c8-4b2c-920b-1998db75531f\', \'multiverseId\': 134119}, \'multiverseid\': 134119}, {\'name\': \'碻林巴洛西\', \'text\': \'延缓5～{G}（除了从你手上使用此牌，你可以支付{G}并将此牌移出对战，且上面有五个计时指示物。 在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。 当你移去最后一个时，则使用它且不需支付其法术力费用。 它具有敏捷。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f050364a-f3af-44a5-b778-ab081b521e45\', \'multiverseId\': 132313}, \'multiverseid\': 132313}]', "[{'name': 'Düsterwaldspurensucher', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T}: Falls der Düsterwaldspurensucher im Spiel ist, fügt er einer angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke zu. Diese Kreatur fügt dem Düsterwaldspurensucher Schaden in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Riese', 'flavor': 'Heutzutage müssen Spurensucher ihrer Beute nicht nur über Meilen hinweg folgen, sondern auch über Jahre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132916&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b5e9e0b-aa3c-4e6f-8dd6-5af13dcefdfc', 'multiverseId': 132916}, 'multiverseid': 132916}, {'name': 'Rastreador del bosque de Durk', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T}: Si el Rastreador del bosque de Durk está en juego, le hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura atacante objetivo. Esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza al Rastreador del bosque de Durk.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': 'Estos días, los rastreadores deben seguir a su presa a través de los años además de la distancia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134421&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a323744-e366-487b-8f6e-32e57d828f55', 'multiverseId': 134421}, 'multiverseid': 134421}, {'name': 'Traqueur de Boissambre', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T} : Si le Traqueur de Boissambre est en jeu, il inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à la créature attaquante ciblée. Cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force au Traqueur de Boissambre.', 'type': 'Créature : géant', 'flavor': 'De nos jours, les traqueurs doivent suivre leur proie pendant des années et des kilomètres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132615&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7b9ba9f-3b43-404c-abaf-e8e50561c0b6', 'multiverseId': 132615}, 'multiverseid': 132615}, {'name': 'Guida di Durkwood', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T}: Se la Guida di Durkwood è in gioco, infligge un danno pari alla propria forza a una creatura attaccante bersaglio. Quella creatura infligge un ammontare di danni pari alla propria forza alla Guida di Durkwood.', 'type': 'Creatura — Gigante', 'flavor': 'Di questi tempi, le guide devono inseguire le loro prede per parecchi anni oltre che per parecchi chilometri.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133217&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25d66923-a129-402b-aa9b-120d3ea89f14', 'multiverseId': 133217}, 'multiverseid': 133217}, {'name': 'ダークウッドの足跡追い', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T}：攻撃しているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ダークウッドの足跡追いが場にある場合、ダークウッドの足跡追いはそれに、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。 そのクリーチャーはダークウッドの足跡追いに、そのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人', 'flavor': '今日では、足跡追いは獲物を距離だけでなく時間でも追わなければいけない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133518&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e480d3c-c1cf-4d4c-b8de-07a2a7c58a0f', 'multiverseId': 133518}, 'multiverseid': 133518}, {'name': 'Rastreador de Durkwood', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T}: Se Rastreador de Durkwood estiver em jogo, ele causará dano igual ao seu poder à criatura alvo atacante. Aquela criatura causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao seu poder a Rastreador de Durkwood.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': 'Atualmente, os rastreadores devem seguir sua presa por vários anos e vários quilômetros.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133819&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d5ae545-0337-4031-aac5-3e5013f0b21c', 'multiverseId': 133819}, 'multiverseid': 133819}, {'name': 'Дарквудский Охотник', 'text': '{1}{G}, {T}: Если Дарквудский Охотник в игре, он наносит повреждения, равные его силе, целевому атакующему существу. Это существо наносит повреждения, равные его силе, Дарквудскому Охотнику.', 'type': 'Существо — Гигант', 'flavor': 'Теперь охотники, преследуя дичь, должны преодолевать не только мили, но и года.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134120&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd041c696-3866-4d90-b96f-7f196ac636a4', 'multiverseId': 134120}, 'multiverseid': 134120}, {'name': '碻林追猎人', 'text': '{1}{G}，{T}：若碻林追猎人在场，则它对目标进行攻击的生物造成等同于碻林追猎人力量的伤害。 该生物对碻林追猎人造成等同于该生物力量的伤害。', 'type': '生物～巨人', 'flavor': '这年头，追猎人不但要长途跋涉，还需经年累月才能得手。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132314&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bfc5f3f-1757-4677-9356-f82d28f4c2ec', 'multiverseId': 132314}, 'multiverseid': 132314}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133039&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b47335c4-75bf-4910-a6d3-f52d1e11a13e', 'multiverseId': 133039}, 'multiverseid': 133039}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=134544&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3b282fa-c2c9-454a-8926-3d7dc43adc01', 'multiverseId': 134544}, 'multiverseid': 134544}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=132738&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '142a1086-e694-4643-8247-6b677f71b28d', 'multiverseId': 132738}, 'multiverseid': 132738}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133340&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '049a0234-47a5-4c62-afcc-411b9ceb0925', 'multiverseId': 133340}, 'multiverseid': 133340}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=133641&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebebbfe4-7445-4455-aefa-3ddd1c8d135a', 'multiverseId': 133641}, 'multiverseid': 133641}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Ima