original_text: ['All Saprolings get +1/+1.\\nMorph {3}{G}{G} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Thelonite Hermit is turned face up, put four 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens into play.', 'All Slivers are colorless.', 'All Slivers get +0/+2.', 'All Slivers get +2/+0.', 'All Slivers get +2/+2.', 'All Slivers have "At the beginning of your upkeep, this creature deals 1 damage to you."', 'All Slivers have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {B}{B} to your mana pool."', 'All Slivers have "This creature can block as though it had flying."', 'All Slivers have "This creature can\'t be blocked except by two or more creatures."', 'All Slivers have "This creature gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Swamp" and "{B}: Regenerate this creature."', 'All Slivers have "When this creature comes into play, destroy target artifact or enchantment."', 'All Slivers have "Whenever a creature dealt damage by this creature this turn is put into a graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature."', 'All Slivers have "Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell an opponent controls, you may draw a card."', 'All Slivers have "Whenever this creature is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on it." (The damage is dealt before the counter is put on.)', 'All Slivers have "{1}, Sacrifice this creature: Each player discards a card."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: Name a card. Target opponent reveals a card at random from his or her hand. If it\'s the named card, that player discards it. Play this ability only during your turn."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: Tap target permanent."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: Target player puts the top card of his or her library into his or her graveyard."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: This creature deals 2 damage to target creature or player 